{"type":"message","id":"17609888","parentId":"fbe80f1d","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:23:45.009Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 06:23:44 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5344783788a0c3218b698bfd177]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5344783788a0c3218b698bfd177\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 06:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\nMac是不是经常会休眠？如果不特别设置的话，所以跟你的通信就断了"}],"timestamp":1774650225006}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0fe95fc","parentId":"17609888","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:23:55.918Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about Mac sleep/hibernation and whether that affects our communication. Let me think about this.\n\nYes, Macs can sleep by default, especially on battery. When a Mac sleeps, the OpenClaw process might still be running but the network could be down, or the Mac might fully hibernate. \n\nHowever, OpenClaw running on a Mac - I need to think about what happens. If OpenClaw is running as a service/daemon on the Mac, it depends on how it was set up. If it's running via the OpenClaw Gateway as a daemon, it might survive sleep or restart on wake.\n\nActually, I should check - OpenClaw has a gateway that runs as a service. If the Mac sleeps, the gateway process might still be running but network connectivity could be interrupted. \n\nThe real issue is that when the Mac wakes from sleep, the gateway daemon should automatically reestablish the tunnel connection, so even though the physical machine was suspended, the connection should recover once it wakes.","thinkingSignature":"c5907da296cc727d4d0ffc98ccef942189eefd8294036519d51a571db7a11d71"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 对，Mac 默认会休眠（尤其是用电池的时候）。休眠后网络会断开的。\n\n不过这取决于 OpenClaw 的部署方式：\n\n- 如果 OpenClaw Gateway 是作为 **系统服务/LaunchDaemon** 运行的，那 Mac 唤醒后服务会自动重新连接，通信会恢复\n- 如果是普通用户进程跑的，休眠时进程可能在，唤醒后网络恢复就能继续\n\n频哥你的 Mac 是哪种方式跑的？我可以帮你看看 gateway 的状态，确认一下唤醒后能不能自动连上。\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":327,"cacheRead":34269,"cacheWrite":524,"totalTokens":35263,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0003924,"cacheRead":0.0020561399999999997,"cacheWrite":0.0001965,"total":0.0026879399999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774650225011,"responseId":"06163671d2eb4765cb8a0e77d70d6741"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fbfd8d19","parentId":"f0fe95fc","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:25:33.062Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 06:25:32 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5344737468a0c2ce3c08fa257c4]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5344737468a0c2ce3c08fa257c4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 06:25 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n我其实是插了电源的，好像默认还是可能休眠，应该怎么设置一下电源策略？"}],"timestamp":1774650333059}}
{"type":"message","id":"3327f470","parentId":"fbfd8d19","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:25:42.678Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about how to configure power settings on Mac to prevent sleep even when plugged in. Let me provide some guidance on Mac power management.","thinkingSignature":"1e4bd976eb67bb180e3599d8730bb677be27df27a27f5e067caa72c93449f930"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 插着电源的话，默认不会休眠，但有时候还是会进入显示器休眠或者系统休眠。\n\n几个方案：\n\n**1. 快速设置（命令行）**\n```bash\n# 防止休眠（当前生效）\nsudo pmset -a sleep 0\nsudo pmset -a displaysleep 0\nsudo pmset -a hibernatemode 0\n\n# 恢复默认\nsudo pmset -a sleep 1\nsudo pmset -a displaysleep 10\nsudo pmset -a hibernatemode 3\n```\n\n**2. 系统设置（GUI）**\n- 🍎 → 系统设置 → 显示器 → 关闭\"显示睡眠\"和\"显示器亮度调整进入低功率模式\"的时间\n- 🍎 → 系统设置 → 电池 → 把电池和电源适配器都设为\"永不休眠\"\n\n**3. 保持 OpenClaw Gateway 在后台稳定运行**\n如果只是想让 Gateway 不断连，其实它断连后人已经\"断线\"了。更好的方案是用 `caffeinate` 命令让 Mac 一直保持唤醒，或者把 OpenClaw 装成服务。\n\n你想直接一劳永逸的话，告诉我你的 Mac 版本，我帮你看一下最合适的方案。\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":296,"cacheRead":34573,"cacheWrite":617,"totalTokens":35629,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00035519999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00207438,"cacheWrite":0.000231375,"total":0.002703855}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774650333064,"responseId":"061636ddefe9f7fc99989de840d52f48"}}
{"type":"message","id":"948eb6f3","parentId":"3327f470","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:26:55.900Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 06:26:54 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53440c2864a4c455d7518648809]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53440c2864a4c455d7518648809\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 06:26 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n怎么查mac的版本？"}],"timestamp":1774650415898}}
{"type":"message","id":"9bb53e55","parentId":"948eb6f3","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:26:59.573Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"User is asking how to check the Mac version.","thinkingSignature":"f82a5a9618466830539602f9aede348580ca195eb7a19e523c8f20aa904fc0fa"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 在终端里运行：\n```bash\nsw_vers\n```\n\n或者点左上角 🍎 → 关于本机 → 里面显示的就是版本号。\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":56,"cacheRead":35125,"cacheWrite":593,"totalTokens":35917,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0000672,"cacheRead":0.0021075,"cacheWrite":0.000222375,"total":0.002439975}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774650415903,"responseId":"0616373002bd6f046a5d19b81e0be18f"}}
