{"type":"message","id":"c60101b6","parentId":"84529719","timestamp":"2026-03-27T22:28:26.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is on macOS Sonoma 14.8.4. That's actually a bit odd - macOS Sonoma is version 14.x, but 14.8.4 seems very high for a minor version. Actually wait, maybe they mean macOS 14.8.4 - which could be a beta? Or maybe they meant 14.6.4 or something. Actually let me just work with what they gave me. \n\nFor macOS Sonoma (14.x), the power settings are in System Settings → Battery (or Energy Settings in older macs). But actually there was no macOS 14.8.4 - the latest Sonoma is 14.x. \n\nSince the user provided that version number, I'll just accept it as is and help them figure out the power settings they need. For Sonoma, the battery and display sleep options are in System Settings → Battery, so I can guide them through adjusting those settings to prevent sleep.","thinkingSignature":"14b1949cbf9ff9b0196d372927479a076405967c08ffd6bb1862013e5f7d63c7"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 好的，Sonoma 14.x。\n\n插电情况下防休眠最简单的方法：\n\n**打开系统设置 → 电池 → 电源适配器**\n\n把以下选项都关了：\n- 开启低功率模式（关闭）\n- 显示器睡眠可以设成\"永不休眠\"或很长的时间\n\n另外，Sonoma 的设置路径是：**🍎 → 系统设置 → 电池 → 电源适配器**\n\n---\n\n或者一个命令搞定：\n```bash\nsudo pmset -a sleep 0 displaysleep 0\n```\n\n输入密码后就永久禁用了。要恢复的话把 0 改成 1。\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":334,"cacheRead":35491,"cacheWrite":540,"totalTokens":36508,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.0004008,"cacheRead":0.0021294599999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00020250000000000002,"total":0.0027756599999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774650496283,"responseId":"0616378120cdc0afa9cb6e7499d5849e"}}
