{"type":"message","id":"5dc8003b","parentId":"b7dc91d9","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:31:15.396Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to build a workflow where:\n1. They send a photo of a mistake/error (错题) from their child's schoolwork\n2. I recognize/extract the text and content from the image\n3. Automatically record it into a Feishu Bitable (多维表格) for tracking junior high school second year (初二) student's subjects\n\nThis is a multi-step workflow that would involve:\n1. Image recognition (already demonstrated - I can analyze images)\n2. Extracting structured information (subject, question, answer, etc.)\n3. Recording to Feishu Bitable\n\nLet me think about the architecture:\n\n1. User sends image via Feishu\n2. OpenClaw receives the image\n3. I use image analysis to extract text/content\n4. I write the data to a Feishu Bitable using the Feishu Bitable tools\n\nFor the Bitable structure, we'd need fields like:\n- 学科 (subject)\n- 题目内容 (question content)\n- 正确答案 (correct answer)\n- 错因分析 (error analysis)\n- 日期 (date)\n- 知识点 (knowledge point)\n\n\n- 难度 (difficulty level)\n\nSince I can already process images and write to Feishu Bitable, the main design decision is how to structure the Bitable schema itself. I should focus on what fields would be most useful for tracking the child's mistakes across different subjects and create a concrete table design.","thinkingSignature":"6168ae07c7569cf4383faf4e4c44803518e4fe47b23a3666ef5f8bbaffc577e9"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 这个完全可以做！我帮你梳理一下方案：\n\n---\n\n## 方案：AI 错题记录系统\n\n### 整体流程\n```\n孩子拍照错题 → 发给你（飞书） → AI识别题目 → 自动写入飞书多维表格\n```\n\n---\n\n### 飞书多维表格设计\n\n建议建一个「初二错题本」，字段如下：\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 学科 | 单选 | 语文/数学/英语/物理/历史/道法/地理/生物 |\n| 题目内容 | 文本 | 识别出的题目文字 |\n| 正确答案 | 文本 | 正确答案/解题思路 |\n| 错因分析 | 文本 | AI自动分析或手动补充 |\n| 知识点 | 多选 | 浮力/压强/一次函数… |\n| 难度 | 单选 | ⭐/⭐⭐/⭐⭐⭐ |\n| 录入时间 | 日期 | 自动记录 |\n| 备注 | 文本 | 自由补充 |\n\n---\n\n### AI 识别内容\n\n发送图片时，AI 会自动提取：\n- 题目全文\n- 对应科目（根据题目内容判断）\n- 正确答案（如果有的话）\n- 匹配知识点标签\n\n---\n\n### 使用方式\n\n1. 孩子拍错题照片，发给你\n2. 你说\"录入错题本\"\n3. AI 自动解析并写入多维表格\n4. 之后可以在飞书里按学科、知识点筛选复习\n\n---\n\n需要我帮你**直接创建这个多维表格**吗？创建好之后发给你链接就可以开始用了 👇\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":645,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":45615,"totalTokens":46387,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.000774,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.017105625,"total":0.017917725}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774661456549,"responseId":"0616625016b19cce8577f1390ab7c75e"}}
