{"type":"message","id":"e61a3cc7","parentId":"3ecf0996","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:37:03.375Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if they just need to send an image directly without any additional message, and I'll automatically record it to the bitable. They're asking for confirmation of the workflow.\n\nCurrently I did record it when they sent \"录入错题本\" after the image. But they seem to be asking if they can just send the image alone without any text.\n\nThe answer is: right now they sent the image + a text message \"录入错题本\". If they just send an image without any text, I wouldn't know whether they want to record it or just show it to me for other purposes.\n\nI should clarify this with them - I need some signal to know \"this image is for the error notebook\". The signal could be:\n\n\n1. They send an image + the text \"录入错题本\"\n2. Or we could agree on some other trigger\n\nI should let them know that currently I still need the \"录入错题本\" signal, but it's a quick message. Alternatively, I could offer to always automatically record any math-related images they send without requiring explicit instruction - but that might catch things they didn't intend to record. I think the clearest approach is to confirm they still need to send some trigger text, even if just \"录入错题本\", to let me know this is specifically for the error notebook rather than a general question.","thinkingSignature":"676617a3215d6dcf2670da9cfdeaae635566433cbcd9d5a20189e5dc5e165f08"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 对的，图片 + \"录入错题本\" 这几个字就行 👍\n\n图片本身我没法判断是随便问问还是真的要录入，所以需要你发一条简短指令告诉我\"这条要录入\"。\n\n流程：\n```\n发图片 + \"录入错题本\" → 我识别 → 自动写入飞书\n```\n\n两个字搞定，不麻烦 😄\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":359,"cacheRead":53675,"cacheWrite":237,"totalTokens":54398,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00043079999999999995,"cacheRead":0.0032205,"cacheWrite":0.0000