{"type":"message","id":"e9c629a3","parentId":"cc585443","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:41:11.402Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_m1own57ling4_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/**\n * Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_drive_file tool -- Manage Feishu Drive files.\n *\n * Actions: list, get_meta, copy, move, delete, upload, download\n *\n * Uses the Feishu Drive API:\n *   - list:        GET    /open-apis/drive/v1/files\n *   - get_meta:    POST   /open-apis/drive/v1/metas/batch_query\n *   - copy:        POST   /open-apis/drive/v1/files/:file_token/copy\n *   - move:        POST   /open-apis/drive/v1/files/:file_token/move\n *   - delete:      DELETE /open-apis/drive/v1/files/:file_token\n *   - upload:      POST   /open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\n *   - download:    GET    /open-apis/drive/v1/files/:file_token/download\n */\nimport type { OpenClawPluginApi } from 'openclaw/plugin-sdk';\nexport declare function registerFeishuDriveFileTool(api: OpenClawPluginApi): boolean;\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774662071397}}
{"type":"message","id":"e672e3b0","parentId":"e9c629a3","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:41:22.627Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's a `feishu_drive_file` tool with `upload` action! This can upload files to Feishu Drive and should return a file_token which can then be used in the bitable attachment field. Let me check the available tools list in the current session - I don't see `feishu_drive_file` in the available tools listed in the system prompt, but it might still be available since it's part of the Feishu plugin.\n\nActually, let me try to use it - the file says it registers with `registerFeishuDriveFileTool`. If it's available, it should work. If not, I'll get an error.\n\nActually, looking at the system prompt tool list, `feishu_drive_file` is NOT in the available tools list. The available tools include `feishu_bitable*`, `feishu_calendar*`, `feishu_chat*`, etc., but not `feishu_drive_file`.\n\nSo the upload tool is not available to me. I need to tell the user this limitation and suggest manual upload for now.","thinkingSignature":"416a18e74500d6ece02a18e6089e24e85706e4bb3d28af3d756a405bf8390eb6"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 我查了一下，目前可用的飞书工具里没有直接上传文件到飞书服务器的功能（`feishu_drive_file` 这个上传接口暂未开放给我）。\n\n所以方案B暂时走不通 😅\n\n---\n\n**目前的方案：**\n\n- 图片已经保存在你本地（`/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/`）\n- 飞书表格里可以手动粘贴图片（打开记录 → 点「原图」字段 → 直接上传）\n\n**如果之后工具升级支持上传了，我再帮你把历史图片都补上。**\n\n---\n\n目前先这样用着，核心的题目内容、答案、知识点、难度都已经自动录入了，复习的时候用文字版也够了 📖\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33797,"output":384,"cacheRead":27992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62173,"cost":{"input":0.0101391,"output":0.0004608,"cacheRead":0.0016795199999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012279420000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774662071403,"responseId":"061664b7a620733bbd530920e9388d1a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b50ffdb","parentId":"e672e3b0","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:43:53.385Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 09:43:52 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53476bb664a4c10f1a3250b0d67]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53476bb664a4c10f1a3250b0d67\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 09:43 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n如果我要查原图，是否有解决方案呢？"}],"timestamp":1774662233382}}
{"type":"message","id":"25172800","parentId":"4b50ffdb","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:44:10.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to be able to view the original images when looking up error records. The issue is that:\n1. The images are saved locally on their Mac\n2. The Feishu bitable attachment field requires uploading to Feishu's server first\n\nSince the images are on their Mac at `/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/`, one option would be to:\n1. Keep the images locally\n2. Add a hyperlink field that points to the local file path (but this wouldn't work remotely)\n3. Use Feishu's drive upload API to upload the images\n\nActually, thinking about this more practically - since the user is accessing Feishu from their phone or remotely, they can't easily access local files on their Mac. \n\nThe most practical solution would be either syncing the images to a cloud service like iCloud Photos so they're accessible from anywhere, or uploading them to Feishu's drive storage. I'm realizing that openclaw's local media files are stored at a path that won't be accessible when the user is viewing Feishu remotely, so I need to think about what's actually practical here.\n\nSince they're on a Mac, they could set up an SMB share or SSH tunnel to access those local files, or they could leverage an existing photo sync service they already use. The simplest path forward is probably just asking what photo service they already have set up.","thinkingSignature":"b7b97a26de3d80e528f6224078c003b55d3a7d7ff95c7f64b7319d972aaa4c72"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 有两个思路：\n\n---\n\n**方案一：iCloud 自动同步（推荐）**\n\n你 Mac 的图片文件夹开启了 iCloud 照片同步的话，可以用\"共享链接\"的方式把原图地址放到飞书里。\n\n开启方法：\n- Mac 上「照片」App → 设置 → iCloud → 开启\"iCloud 照片\"\n- 电脑上右键图片 → 复制 iCloud 链接 → 粘贴到飞书表格的「原图」字段（改成\"超链接\"类型）\n\n---\n\n**方案二：飞书云文档中转**\n\n创建一个飞书云文档，每道错题的截图先上传到云文档，再把链接放到多维表格里。\n\n---\n\n**方案三：后续我帮你搞定上传**\n\n等飞书插件后续版本支持上传接口了，我可以直接把图片上传到飞书服务器，这条路最省事。\n\n---\n\n你觉得哪个方案更适合？iCloud 方案最简单，频哥你可以试试 📱\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":486,"cacheRead":55643,"cacheWrite":6033,"totalTokens":62289,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0005832,"cacheRead":0.00333858,"cacheWrite":0.002262375,"total":0.0062222549999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774662233388,"responseId":"061665593fbaa9577b1ae6b34c242c3f"}}
