{"type":"message","id":"1041036f","parentId":"a9935e8f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:45:55.745Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The field for \"原图\" has `field_id: \"fldKWDhz1r\"` and `type: 17` (Attachment). Let me try to update the record using the field_id to reference it.Actually, looking at the record update tool - it uses `field_name` not `field_id` in the fields object. Let me try again with the field name \"原图\".Wait, the issue might be the attachment format. According to the bitable skill documentation:> 附件字段：必须先上传到当前多维表格，使用返回的 file_tokenSo the file needs to be uploaded to the BITABLE specifically (not just to cloud drive), and then the file_token from THAT upload is what goes into the attachment field.Let me check if the upload I just did (to cloud drive/explorer) is sufficient, or if I need a different approach.Actually looking at the doc more carefully:```\n### 17. 附件 (type=17)\n\n**Property 结构**: 空对象或省略\n\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": 17,\n  \"field_name\": \"附件\",\n  \"property\": {}\n}\n```\n\n**注意**:\n- 单个单元格附件数不超过 100\n- 写入前需先调用[上传素材接口](https://go.feishu.cn/s/63soQp6O80s)\n```\n\nThe key issue is that for attachments in Bitable, I need to use their specific upload API, not the general file upload endpoint. The file_token I got from the drive upload won't work directly - I need to call the dedicated bitable media upload endpoint instead.\n\nLooking at the API docs, `POST /open-apis/drive/v1/medias/upload_all` is the correct endpoint, and I can pass `bitable_type` and `bitable_token` parameters to target a specific bitable. The current upload was to the cloud drive (explorer) using the generic endpoint, so I need to re-upload with the bitable-specific parameters.\n\nActually, re-examining the skill documentation more carefully - attachments in bitable require a dedicated upload endpoint, not the generic file upload. The standard `feishu_drive_file` upload likely won't work for this use case.\n\nLet me verify whether the previous upload actually failed or if there's a different approach needed for bitable attachments specifically.","thinkingSignature":"5830972e56b1d471d51e798b9b7305d400b0ec9579d6142cebdb21ed43b780dd"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_49dppjbx6xpq_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","record_id":"recvf7BUzqEFSD","fields":{"原图":[{"file_token":"boxbcGaNWDdgdGtI2OdljcbTngd"}]}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":44865,"output":616,"cacheRead":27992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":73473,"cost":{"input":0.0134595,"output":0.0007392,"cacheRead":0.0016795199999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01587822}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774662340191,"responseId":"061665c4a7443e3c125e325e49b06e90"}}
