{"type":"message","id":"11ecb01b","parentId":"1f303fdd","timestamp":"2026-03-28T01:47:03.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to use Option 1: change the \"原图\" field to a hyperlink type and store the cloud disk link. I need to:\n1. Delete the \"原图\" field (type 17, Attachment)\n2. Create a new field \"原图链接\" of type 15 (URL/hyperlink)\n3. Update the record with the URL\n\nThe file_token from the upload was `boxbcGaNWDdgdGtI2OdljcbTngd`.\nThe file link format would be: `https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/file/{file_token}` or similar.\n\nActually, looking at the feishu docs, the file link would be something like `https://{tenant}.feishu.cn/file/{file_token}`.\n\nBut let me check what the actual URL format is. \n\nFor feishu cloud files, the URL format is typically:\n`https://{domain}/file/{file_token}`\n\nSince the bitable is at `tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/base/...`, the file would likely be at:\n`https://tcnorh11898l.feishu.cn/file/boxbcGaNWDdgdGtI2OdljcbTngd`\n\nLet me first delete the existing \"原图\" field and create a new URL field in its place, then update the record.","thinkingSignature":"769083686fbe6d78956bf6a34832a5d3ab9d25d4c04a96eb98b9ca96a47d6ece"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6w9q519y4cen_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_field","arguments":{"action":"delete","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","field_id":"fldKWDhz1r"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":385,"cacheRead":27992,"cacheWrite":44276,"totalTokens":72780,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00046199999999999995,"cacheRead":0.0016795199999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0166035,"total":0.01878312}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774662412018,"responseId":"0616660dae57bd7a6d34762e5e6206a0"}}
