{"type":"message","id":"3a2cb1cd","parentId":"71426799","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:07:47.386Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_wl1apnohvq1u_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/**\n * Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_doc_media tool -- 文档媒体管理（插入 + 下载）\n *\n * Actions:\n *   insert   - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（3 步流程）\n *   download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地\n *\n * 使用以下 SDK 接口:\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlockChildren.create - 创建子块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll - 上传素材\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlock.batchUpdate - 批量更新块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.download - 下载素材\n * - sdk.board.v1.whiteboard.downloadAsImage - 下载画板缩略图\n */\nimport type { OpenClawPluginApi } from 'openclaw/plugin-sdk';\nexport declare function registerDocMediaTool(api: OpenClawPluginApi): boolean;"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":11,"aggregated":"/**\n * Copyright (c) 2026 ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n *\n * feishu_doc_media tool -- 文档媒体管理（插入 + 下载）\n *\n * Actions:\n *   insert   - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（3 步流程）\n *   download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地\n *\n * 使用以下 SDK 接口:\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlockChildren.create - 创建子块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll - 上传素材\n * - sdk.docx.documentBlock.batchUpdate - 批量更新块\n * - sdk.drive.v1.media.download - 下载素材\n * - sdk.board.v1.whiteboard.downloadAsImage - 下载画板缩略图\n */\nimport type { OpenClawPluginApi } from 'openclaw/plugin-sdk';\nexport declare function registerDocMediaTool(api: OpenClawPluginApi): boolean;","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774663667382}}
{"type":"message","id":"753a019a","parentId":"3a2cb1cd","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:07:55.279Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's a `feishu_doc_media` tool that handles inserting images into Feishu docs. It uses `sdk.drive.v1.media.uploadAll`. But this tool is for inserting into docs, not for general cloud drive files.\n\nThe issue with the `feishu_drive_file` upload is that when we uploaded with `parent_type: 'explorer'`, the file might have been uploaded to a temporary space that's not accessible via the returned token.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The upload API returned a file_token. Let me try to get the actual file URL from the Feishu file itself. Maybe the file IS there but the URL format is wrong.\n\n\nI should test the file_token I got back to see if I can retrieve the actual download URL. Let me run a download action and check what response I get.","thinkingSignature":"1328e45045d42f61de86002a166e2d0984c031724c79da9c222f155407909a9c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sf2f1td7hy9a_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"media.uploadAll\\|uploadAll\\|drive.*upload\" ~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/ --include=\"*.js\" -A 2 | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":51846,"output":238,"cacheRead":27992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80076,"cost":{"input":0.0155538,"output":0.0002856,"cacheRead":0.0016795199999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01751892}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774663667386,"responseId":"06166af30b54c5de6e17aa3b19339e32"}}
