{"type":"message","id":"ed067da9","parentId":"d71c249b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:11:33.191Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can write to this file. Let me modify the description to include bitable_upload and also check if the tool is properly registered.\n\nActually, looking at the code again, the description says:\n```\ndescription: '【以用户身份】文档媒体管理工具。' +\n    '支持两种操作：' +\n    '(1) insert - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（需要文档 ID + 本地文件路径）；' +\n    '(2) download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地（需要资源 token + 输出路径）。' +\n```\n\nI need to add bitable_upload to this description so it shows up in the tool's registered description.\n\n\nThe real issue is that I don't have a tool to call in the first place. Even though bitable_upload is implemented in the execute function and defined in the schema, it's not exposed as a callable tool because the description doesn't mention it and it's not in my available tools list. The solution is to update the description to include bitable_upload so it becomes discoverable.","thinkingSignature":"a51a27ccb419c24e90948e1c14993fcc4f4219e1ebfd40f0710ef50fc7c44127"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_s1vqkhwipjly_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file":"~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js","old_string":"        description: '【以用户身份】文档媒体管理工具。' +\n            '支持两种操作：' +\n            '(1) insert - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（需要文档 ID + 本地文件路径）；' +\n            '(2) download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地（需要资源 token + 输出路径）。' +\n            '\\n\\n【重要】insert 仅支持本地文件路径。URL 图片请使用 create-doc/update-doc 的 <image url=\"...\"/> 语法。',","new_string":"        description: '【以用户身份】文档媒体管理工具。' +\n            '支持三种操作：' +\n            '(1) insert - 在飞书文档末尾插入本地图片或文件（需要文档 ID + 本地文件路径）；' +\n            '(2) download - 下载文档素材或画板缩略图到本地（需要资源 token + 输出路径）；' +\n            '(3) bitable_upload - 上传本地文件到多维表格的附件字段（需要 app_token + table_id + field_id + 本地文件路径）。' +\n            '\\n\\n【重要】insert 仅支持本地文件路径。URL 图片请使用 create-doc/update-doc 的 <image u