{"type":"message","id":"c4c04c22","parentId":"eed9f35a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:23:21.283Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"MEMORY.md doesn't exist yet. Let me create it with this important technical knowledge.","thinkingSignature":"104364ade373c59f02ab0bdebd69d911fc4dc0c7267bec6e758b5ed5cd8e192b"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tx243m9w1e2y_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# MEMORY.md - 苹果虾的长期记忆\n\n## 技术经验\n\n### 🔑 飞书 Bitable 附件上传的关键发现（2026-03-28）\n\n**问题：** 上传图片到飞书多维表格（Bitable）的附件字段时，文件 token 无法被识别，链接打开显示 404。\n\n**根本原因：** 飞书有两套文件存储系统：\n- `drive.file.uploadAll`（云盘 API）→ 返回通用 file_token，只能在云盘使用\n- `drive.v1.media.uploadAll` + `extra.bitablePerm`（bitable 专用 API）→ 返回 bitable 专用 token，可以被附件字段直接识别和预览\n\n**解决方案：**\n1. 使用 `feishu_doc_media` 工具的 `bitable_upload` action（注意：此工具 description 起初没有完整描述 bitable_upload，需要主动查看源码确认）\n2. 文件路径限制：只允许 `/tmp/` 下的文件，上传前需先复制到临时目录\n3. 上传成功后拿到 file_token，直接写入 bitable 记录即可预览\n\n**相关文件：**\n- 插件源码：`~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js`\n- 工具名称：`feishu_doc_media`\n- action: `bitable_upload`\n- 参数字段：app_token, table_id, field_id, file_path（必须是 /tmp/ 下）\n\n---\n\n## 关于频哥\n\n- 位置：成都\n- 孩子：初二，正在用飞书多维表格记录错题\n- 偏好：中文沟通，直接给AI起名字很有创意\n- 飞书多维表格「初二错题本」：app_token=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\n","file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60605,"output":440,"cacheRead":34000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95045,"cost":{"input":0.0181815,"output":0.0005279999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0020399999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0207495}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774664587818,"responseId":"06166e8b201eab4ac31240fac75f1204"}}
