{"type":"message","id":"d4b494ac","parentId":"94e98853","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:23:33.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me create today's daily memory file.","thinkingSignature":"037712b1903bfaba4312fcfb8448fb699e3f38c6fbea4c0258fe99be63626901"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6xb5ssgmj0q8_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 2026-03-28 日志\n\n## 今天发生的事\n\n### 错题本系统搭建\n- 为频哥搭建了「初二错题本」飞书多维表格\n- 表结构：学科、题目内容、正确答案、错因分析、知识点（多选）、难度（⭐）、录入时间、备注、原图\n- 完整流程打通：发图片+指令 → AI识别 → 自动录入飞书表格（含原图）\n\n### 技术突破\n- 解决飞书 Bitable 附件上传问题（见 MEMORY.md 详细记录）\n- 关键：使用 feishu_doc_media 的 bitable_upload action，文件需复制到 /tmp/ 下\n- 修改了 doc-media.js 的 description，重启 Gateway 使修改生效\n\n### 频哥闲聊\n- 聊了美以伊战事最新进展、黄金价格走势\n- Mac 休眠问题咨询（Sonoma 14.x，pmset 禁用休眠）\n- 对多模态图片识别很感兴趣\n\n","file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-28.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61163,"output":273,"cacheRead":34000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95436,"cost":{"input":0.018348899999999998,"output":0.0003276,"cacheRead":0.0020399999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0207165}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774664604601,"responseId":"06166e9c201ae044e6249d4ee0092053"}}
