{"type":"message","id":"60f08609","parentId":"fc19caec","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:29:07.633Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to record this English question into the wrong topic table. Let me first copy the image to /tmp/, then upload to bitable, then create the record with all the details.\n\nLet me:\n1. Copy image to /tmp/\n2. Upload via bitable_upload\n3. Create record with fields\n\nThe question details:\n- Subject: 英语\n- Topic: Unit 2 Stay Healthy, B卷短文填空\n- Content: 10个空的短文填空，备选词有12个\n- Knowledge points: 词性转换（名词变动词/形容词等）\n- Difficulty: I'd say ⭐⭐ since it's B卷 exam question\n\nNote the knowledge points from the available options that match:\n\n\n- 词性 (for the word form changes)\n- 完形填空 (this is a close match to 短文填空)\n- 其他\n\nThe key here is that students need to convert words between different forms—happy to happily, hurt to painful, quick to quickly, describe to description—so I should emphasize 词性 and 完形填空 as the main knowledge points for this exercise.","thinkingSignature":"6635276507bc49cffbf1f3198686ca0f6c11e259bbe49b8e82e7ae0e40eb5ac4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h0h7nwr4yrt7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/d151f650-3a88-4420-adaa-d576fb7ab978.jpg /var/folders/8r/0b88l2d52ys5974p0fms08mr0000gn/T/english_unit2.jpg && echo \"copied\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":324,"cacheRead":88898,"cacheWrite":1307,"totalTokens":90656,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00038879999999999996,"cacheRead":0.005333879999999999,"cacheWrite":0.000490125,"total":0.006250904999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774664938004,"responseId":"06166feac7b0b3c2484281aacb2187d4"}}
