{"type":"message","id":"025580a8","parentId":"d0489ea0","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:38:59.406Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tool worked this time! Now I need to update the record to include the file_token. The record ID for the English topic is \"recvf7PmchaMw2\".\n\nActually, wait - when I called the bitable_upload, it already uploaded the file to the field. But I still need to associate it with the record. Let me check if the upload automatically created a record or if I need to link it.\n\nLooking at the bitable_upload result, it seems like it uploaded to the field but didn't create a record. I need to link this file_token to the existing record.\n\nLet me update the record.","thinkingSignature":"f94110e675d8f5de1d202ade5735e14e51ef8cc7c4e23474898926f6cfd9a5cc"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ejgr1cspx2nt_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","record_id":"recvf7PmchaMw2","fields":{"原图":[{"file_token":"KRYxbbwgwoRVzlxZ3tscREbRnjg"}]}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":79489,"output":261,"cacheRead":34391,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114141,"cost":{"input":0.0238467,"output":0.00031319999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0020634599999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.026223359999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774665532645,"responseId":"0616723cc3bccb6b88d77581392c0106"}}
