{"type":"message","id":"7e773538","parentId":"72d2096a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:51:13.423Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The SDK has both `lib` (CommonJS) and `es` (ES modules) directories. Let me write a script that uses the SDK directly to upload a file to bitable.\n\nLet me write a standalone script that:\n1. Uses the Feishu SDK with the same credentials that OpenClaw uses\n2. Uploads the file to bitable storage\n3. Returns the file_token\n\nI need to figure out how OpenClaw loads the SDK and what credentials it uses. Looking at the doc-media.js code, it uses `toolClient()` which is created by `helpers.js`. Let me write a script that uses the SDK with the same approach.Actually, instead of trying to figure out OpenClaw's internal SDK usage, let me write a simple script that:\n\n\n1. Reads the config from `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`\n2. Uses the Feishu SDK to upload the file\n\nLet me check what's in the config file.","thinkingSignature":"fb4606b8cf31fe5434055ec36955dd877b1414f000349462a2cf0ce236db8a33"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_squlpgerr6j5_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | grep -A5 -B5 \"feishu\\|lark\" | head -40"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":88354,"output":249,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":116986,"cost":{"input":0.026506199999999997,"output":0.0002988,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028507979999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774666264926,"responseId":"061675194800b5bf3b803aba55b4370e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d48357b0","parentId":"7e773538","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:51:13.453Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_squlpgerr6j5_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"}\n  },\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"profile\": \"full\",\n    \"alsoAllow\": [\n      \"feishu_bitable_app\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_field\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_record\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_view\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_calendar\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_event\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_event_attendee\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_freebusy\",\n      \"feishu_chat\",\n      \"feishu_chat_members\",\n      \"feishu_create_doc\",\n      \"feishu_doc_comments\",\n      \"feishu_doc_media\",\n      \"feishu_drive_file\",\n      \"feishu_fetch_doc\",\n      \"feishu_get_user\",\n      \"feishu_im_bot_image\",\n      \"feishu_im_user_fetch_resource\",\n      \"feishu_im_user_get_messages\",\n      \"feishu_im_user_get_thread_messages\",\n      \"feishu_im_user_message\",\n      \"feishu_im_user_search_messages\",\n      \"feishu_oauth\",\n      \"feishu_oauth_batch_auth\",\n      \"feishu_search_doc_wiki\",\n      \"feishu_search_user\",\n      \"feishu_sheet\",\n      \"feishu_task_comment\",\n      \"feishu_task_subtask\",\n      \"feishu_task_task\",\n      \"feishu_task_tasklist\",\n      \"feishu_update_doc\",\n      \"feishu_wiki_space\",\n      \"feishu_wiki_space_node\""}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":17,"aggregated":"}\n  },\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"profile\": \"full\",\n    \"alsoAllow\": [\n      \"feishu_bitable_app\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_field\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_record\",\n      \"feishu_bitable_app_table_view\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_calendar\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_event\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_event_attendee\",\n      \"feishu_calendar_freebusy\",\n      \"fe