{"type":"message","id":"20834354","parentId":"ed756035","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:53:21.399Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token is retrieved! It's 5704 characters long (which is a full OAuth token). Now I can use this token to call the Feishu API directly.Let me write a Node.js script that:1. Gets the token from Keychain2. Uses it to call the Feishu API for bitable upload\n\nActually, I can just use curl! The Feishu API is HTTP-based. Let me get the user access token first, then use it to call the bitable upload API.\n\nThe flow is:1. Get user access token from Keychain\n2. Use it to call `POST /open-apis/drive/v1/media/upload_all` with `extra.bitablePerm`3. \n\nOnce I get the file_token back, I can update the bitable record with it. Let me start by retrieving the access token from Keychain.","thinkingSignature":"cb5febe6c12e53325cbf883fb070032d5c4174c751bfcbae50815da8703e4dc2"},{"type":"text","text":"拿到用户 Token 了！现在直接用 API 上传：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l29pivpu0q5y_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"USER_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null)\n\n# Upload file to bitable\nRESPONSE=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/media/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $USER_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: multipart/form-data\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=math_inequality.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_file\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=235941\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/var/folders/8r/0b88l2d52ys5974p0fms08mr0000gn/T/math_inequality.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\"}}')\n\necho \"$RESPONSE\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":94044,"output":484,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":122911,"cost":{"input":0.028213199999999997,"output":0.0005808,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.030496979999999996}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774666388031,"responseId":"06167594ba9df2e92ef003841aab0779"}}
