{"type":"message","id":"5a06b8a8","parentId":"59a30efc","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:55:32.371Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see! The SDK's `uploadAll` method is using `drive/v1/files/upload_all` NOT `drive/v1/media/upload_all`!\n\nThe key line:\n```javascript\nurl: fillApiPath(`${this.domain}/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`, path),\n```\n\nSo the correct endpoint is:\n`https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`\n\nNOT:\n`https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/media/upload_all`\n\nLet me try with the correct endpoint.","thinkingSignature":"38ce4fcab75fed3059bbdb16a916bb2ea6538cf4ac21e0eb53b43cec56a777f8"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！正确 endpoint 是 `drive/v1/files/upload_all`，不是 `media/upload_all`：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6qvyzsd0drvr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"FULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=math_inequality.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=235941\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/var/folders/8r/0b88l2d52ys5974p0fms08mr0000gn/T/math_inequality.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\"}}'","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100811,"output":437,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129631,"cost":{"input":0.030243299999999997,"output":0.0005244,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03247068}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774666520961,"responseId":"06167619d081422516