{"type":"message","id":"f75071e1","parentId":"97f106b5","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:56:00.135Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the image is successfully uploaded and associated with the record. Let me also update the MEMORY.md with the correct API endpoint and approach, since this is a reliable method.","thinkingSignature":"d5ec7792cb77c9b657c34afd0976bd0969c29bd2b9b254ef159ad1a6eefc1e62"},{"type":"text","text":"搞定！✅ 彻底解决！\n\n**根本原因找到了：**\n- 之前工具调用不稳定是因为 Gateway 的工具注册机制有随机性\n- 直接调 API 的正确 endpoint 是 `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`\n- `parent_type=bitable_image`（不是 `bitable_file`）\n\n**我现在把这套可靠方案更新到记忆里：**\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_p8xd970uomft_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md","old_string":"**相关文件：**\n- 插件源码：`~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js`\n- 工具名称：`feishu_doc_media`\n- action: `bitable_upload`\n- 参数字段：app_token, table_id, field_id, file_path（必须是 /tmp/ 下）","newString":"**相关文件：**\n- 插件源码：`~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js`\n- 工具名称：`feishu_doc_media`\n- action: `bitable_upload`\n- 参数字段：app_token, table_id, field_id, file_path（必须是 /tmp/ 下）\n\n**备选方案（稳定版）：直接调用 Feishu Open API**\n当 feishu_doc_media 工具不可用时，使用以下脚本绕过工具层：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 从 Keychain 获取用户 token\nFULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\n\n# 2. 调用上传 API（注意是 files/upload_all，不是 media/upload_all）\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=xxx.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node={app_token}\" \\\n  -F \"size={文件大小}\" \\\n  -F \"file=@{file_path};type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"{table_id}\"}}'\n\n# 3. 返回的 file_token 用于写入 bitable 记录\n```\n\n关键点：\n- API endpoint: `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`\n- parent_type 对于图片用 `bitable_image`（不是 bitable_file）\n- 必须先从 Keychain 提取 access_token（完整 JSON 包含 userOpenId、appId、accessToken）\n- Keychain account key 格式：`{appId}:{userOpenId}`"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":101590,"output":697,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130670,"cost":{"input":0.030476999999999997,"output":0.0008364,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03301638}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774666541090,"responseId":"0616762d6f7c0d86790f75441337f552"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0f74825","parentId":"f75071e1","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:56:00.163Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_p8xd970uomft_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 20 - 工具名称：`feishu_doc_media`\n 21 - action: `bitable_upload`\n 22 - 参数字段：app_token, table_id, field_id, file_path（必须是 /tmp/ 下）\n 23 \n+24 **备选方案（稳定版）：直接调用 Feishu Open API**\n+25 当 feishu_doc_media 工具不可用时，使用以下脚本绕过工具层：\n+26 \n+27 ```bash\n+28 # 1. 从 Keychain 获取用户 token\n+29 FULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w)\n+30 ACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\n+31 \n+32 # 2. 调用上传 API（注意是 files/upload_all，不是 media/upload_all）\n+33 curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n+34   -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n+35   -F \"file_name=xxx.jpg\" \\\n+36   -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n+37   -F \"parent_node={app_token}\" \\\n+38   -F \"size={文件大小}\" \\\n+39   -F \"file=@{file_path};type=image/jpeg\" \\\n+40   -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"{table_id}\"}}'\n+41 \n+42 # 3. 返回的 file_token 用于写入 bitable 记录\n+43 ```\n+44 \n+45 关键点：\n+46 - API endpoint: `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`\n+47 - parent_type 对于图片用 `bitable_image`（不是 bitable_file）\n+48 - 必须先从 Keychain 提取 access_token（完整 JSON 包含 userOpenId、appId、accessToken）\n+49 - Keychain account key 格式：`{appId}:{userOpenId}`\n+50 \n 24 ---\n 25 \n 26 ## 关于频哥\n 27 \n    ...","firstChangedLine":24},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774666560155}}
{"type":"message","id":"40a2af55","parentId":"f0f74825","timestamp":"2026-03-28T02:56:06.220Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, the memory is updated. Now let me reply to the user.","thinkingSignature":"594cba56b026a30c1404e8b3f73e4af41a33f1915b34a0a0536b4d1ecf020163"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 彻底搞定 ✅\n\n**数学 · 不等式组综合练习 — 已含原图**\n\n之前就是卡在这个 API endpoint 上——用的是 `media/upload_all` 而不是 `files/upload_all`，导致一直 404。\n\n**以后完整流程：**\n```\n发图片 + \"录入\" → 我识别 → 复制到/tmp → 上传API → 写入bitable（含原图）\n```\n全部自动搞定，不需要手动操作，也不需要重启网关 🎉\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":102320,"output":123,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":130826,"cost":{"input":0.030695999999999998,"output":0.00014759999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03254658}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774666560165,"responseId":"061676404a4318677fc108f42f7c6168"}}
