{"type":"message","id":"05966455","parentId":"00d145ce","timestamp":"2026-03-28T03:06:24.361Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, now I've updated both the MEMORY.md with a comprehensive review and the daily log. Let me give the user a summary.","thinkingSignature":"01b41c5fec0578c807131d0b85def01ecda2a05af7dd37c2bc164597cda5678c"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 完整复盘已写入长期记忆 ✅\n\n**MEMORY.md 更新内容：**\n\n1. **问题完整脉络** — 从发现到解决的全过程\n2. **两套 API 的本质区别** — 云盘 API vs Bitable 专用 API\n3. **两种解决方案** — 工具层 + 直接 API 层（含完整 curl 命令）\n4. **踩过的所有坑** — endpoint 错误、parent_type 错误、Keychain 提取方法\n5. **完整业务流程** — 从发图片到录入的每一步\n\n**关键结论（以后直接用）：**\n- 优先用直接 API：`https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all` + `extra.bitablePerm`\n- 工具（`feishu_doc_media.bitbucket_upload`）作为备选，不稳定时直接调 API\n\n以后遇到同类问题，直接查 MEMORY.md，不用再绕路了 😄\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":100599,"output":236,"cacheRead":28383,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":129218,"cost":{"input":0.0301797,"output":0.0002832,"cacheRead":0.0017029799999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03216588}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774667174659,"responseId":"061678a6d31f54a1a07c16c4380ce72c"}}
