{"type":"message","id":"b2e19b9f","parentId":"dd930e2a","timestamp":"2026-03-28T03:40:56.600Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if there's detailed documentation about the image upload solution. They probably want to know if the MEMORY.md and the deployment manual cover the image upload troubleshooting well enough. Let me check if the deployment manual I just wrote is comprehensive enough for the image upload issue.\n\nActually, looking at what I wrote, the deployment manual does cover the key points about image upload (endpoint, parent_type, extra parameter). But the user might be asking if there's detailed enough documentation about the solution process - the wrong turns, the debugging, etc. \n\nLet me confirm what's in the docs and let the user know.","thinkingSignature":"d9dcd6dce687fc865aef9cf198fcf01fe3040472d19026b9abde8e3c1b9bd3e2"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 有的，手册里专门有一部分：\n\n**「故障排查 - 图片上传返回 404」** — 列出了三个最容易踩的坑：\n1. endpoint 用了 `media/upload_all` 而不是 `files/upload_all`\n2. `parent_type` 用了 `bitable_file` 而不是 `bitable_image`\n3. 缺少 `extra.bitablePerm` 参数\n\n---\n\n**如果你想看更完整的调试过程**，MEMORY.md 里记录了完整的排查脉络：\n\n- 最初发现云盘 API 和 bitable API 的区别\n- `feishu_doc_media` 工具里 `bitable_upload` 是 hidden action 的曲折发现\n- 走过的弯路：endpoint 错误、parent_type 错误、Keychain token 提取方式等\n\n---\n\n你想看哪个？手册偏\"怎么用\"，MEMORY.md 偏\"怎么解决的\" 📖\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":315,"cacheRead":17632,"cacheWrite":117439,"totalTokens":135513,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00037799999999999997,"cacheRead":0.00105792,"cacheWrite":0.044039625,"total":0.045513645}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774669242259,"responseId":"061680ba7cd5dc8216abbaf43733f4be"}}
