{"type":"message","id":"cd4e2070","parentId":"ed623eb0","timestamp":"2026-03-28T06:35:47.339Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to update the existing English wrong question record with more detailed weakness analysis and study guidance. Let me update the record with:\n\n1. More detailed weakness analysis in the 备注 field\n2. Add specific learning recommendations\n\nThe record ID is `recvf7PmchaMw2` (the English wrong topic).\n\nLet me update it with richer information.","thinkingSignature":"c645d6f15a5e51bd23e43441821e1952989602d209740075f68d7468bb02c681"},{"type":"text","text":"先把现有的英语错题补充完整：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xrpme1cfn2ys_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"update","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","record_id":"recvf7PmchaMw2","fields":{"备注":"【薄弱点诊断】\n① 词性转换判断力弱：pain→painful/happily、quick→quickly、luck→lucky 等词根到副词/形容词的变形不熟悉\n② 反身代词易混淆：we→ourselves（容易写成 ourselveselves 或漏掉变形）\n③ 不定代词变形：other→another（an+other 的结合不熟）\n④ 词义精准度：pain vs painful、harm vs hurt 语义相近词的选择判断力弱\n\n【推荐练习】\n1. 每日3组词性转换闪卡（pain/happy/luck/thank/quick 四个词根的四形态）\n2. 重点练反身代词：ourselves/themselves/yourselves\n3. 词性判断三步法：先判断空里要 adj/adv/n/v，再从选项挑\n\n【下次考试重点】\n- 词性转换（adj↔adv↔n）\n- 反身代词\n- 介词搭配（in/on/at）","知识点":["词性转换","反身代词","完形填空","词义辨析"]}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":452,"cacheRead":144691,"cacheWrite":531,"totalTokens":145801,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0005424,"cacheRead":0.008681459999999998,"cacheWrite":0.000199125,"total":0.009461084999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774679726570,"responseId":"0616a9afea61efe85cc4dbdfd70fbdd9"}}
