{"type":"message","id":"8895f97d","parentId":"5991e3aa","timestamp":"2026-03-28T06:42:05.602Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. The new bitable has:\n- 学科 (single select) - has 语文/数学/英语/物理/历史/道法/地理/生物\n- 题目内容 (text)\n- 正确答案 (text)\n- 错因分析 (text) - this maps to the wrong answer from old table\n- 知识点 (multi-select) - has many options but not all (几何旋转, 现在完成时, 非延续性动词, 青藏地区农业, 台湾岛自然地理特征, 滑动摩擦力 etc. are missing)\n\n\n- 难度 (single select) - ⭐/⭐⭐/⭐⭐⭐\n- 录入时间 (date)\n- 备注 (text)\n- 原图链接 (url) - text\n- 原图 (attachment)\n\nI need to map the old fields to the new structure and then batch create 8 records. The 旧表 has 8 records with 科目 as 学科 (math, English, geography, physics), 题目 as 题目内容, 正确答案, and 错误答案 that maps to 错因分析.\n\nFor 知识点, I need to handle the fact that some values like 几何旋转 don't exist in the new table yet—they'll either need to be created or I can add them to 备注. I can see that 力与运动 is already available, so I can use that directly.\n\nNow I'm mapping each record: 数学 maps to 数学, 英语 to 英语, 地理 to 地理, and 物理 to 物理 with 力与运动 as the 知识点. The 掌握程度 field will help determine difficulty, with higher mastery levels corresponding to easier ratings. The attachment URLs from the old table will need to be preserved in the new structure. I'll need to handle image attachments from the old records and preserve the original entry dates, then batch create all 8 records at once. Before I do that, I should update the knowledge point options to include missing categories like 几何旋转, 现在完成时, and 青藏地区农业, or alternatively just write the full text to the 备注 field to keep things simple.\n\nNow I'm mapping out the old records: the math record has 几何旋转, 等腰三角形, 正方形, 面积计算 with difficulty ⭐⭐⭐ and already has an image attachment; the English records cover 现在完成时 vs 一般过去时 and 非延续性动词; and there are two geography records with 青藏地区农业 and 台湾岛自然地理特征 that I need to handle carefully.\n\nI'm also noting the physics records—one on 滑动摩擦力 and 力与运动状态, another on 力和运动—plus there's a batch create issue where I can provide new select options that will auto-create if they don't already exist.\n\nFor the mastery tracking, the old table uses a 0-2 scale (未掌握/基本掌握/已掌握), but the new table uses star difficulty ratings, so I need to map those accordingly: ⭐⭐⭐ for unmastered, ⭐⭐ for partially mastered, and ⭐ for fully mastered content. I also need to preserve the original entry dates from the old table as 录入时间 in the new one, and I'm looking at the field structure to understand what I'm working with.\n\nThe key issue is that the old table has text-based knowledge points while the new one uses multi-select options, so I'll need to convert those text descriptions into the appropriate select values, though some like 几何旋转 aren't in the current options list yet. Let me start preparing the records for batch creation and handle the knowledge points mapping as I go.","thinkingSignature":"cdbaba39b6a1a0e6c015ec80a1db4cb66bf86953036b5af27ca6d9a09023861c"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先在知识点里增加几个旧表用到的选项，然后批量导入：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wwt80iwt6rgw_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_field","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","field_name":"知识点","type":4,"property":"{\"options\": [{\"color\": 0, \"name\": \"几何旋转\"}, {\"color\": 1, \"name\": \"现在完成时\"}, {\"color\": 2, \"name\": \"非延续性动词\"}, {\"color\": 3, \"name\": \"青藏地区农业\"}, {\"color\": 4, \"name\": \"台湾地理\"}, {\"color\": 5, \"name\": \"滑动摩擦力\"}, {\"color\": 6, \"name\": \"受力分析\"}]}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":113916,"output":961,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":143261,"cost":{"input":0.0341748,"output":0.0011531999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03703104}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774680094601,"responseId":"0616ab1ed0853e39743386b21ba9f0ab"}}
