{"type":"message","id":"5a558d5f","parentId":"dd6af6d8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:08:55.841Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 15:08:54 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b5343a69044a0c142739eeac03cb]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5343a69044a0c142739eeac03cb\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 15:08 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n其它科目的错题分析怎么处理呢？"}],"timestamp":1774681735834}}
{"type":"message","id":"999f6d9c","parentId":"5a558d5f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:09:20.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about how to handle wrong topic analysis for other subjects (besides English). They want to know the workflow for analyzing and tracking weak points across all subjects.\n\nCurrently, the wrong topic records have basic fields but not a systematic \"weak point diagnosis\" field like the English ones do. The English wrong topics have detailed notes about what specific grammar points need work.\n\nThe user wants to know how to handle analysis for other subjects (Math, Physics, Geography, etc.) in a similar way to what we did for English.\n\nLet me think about this:\n1. For Math - analysis could include: specific problem types, calculation errors, conceptual misunderstandings, geometry skills, etc.\n2. For Physics - could include: formula application, unit conversion, diagram analysis, conceptual understanding\n\n\n3. For Geography - could include: map reading, regional knowledge, cause-effect relationships, etc.\n\nThe current \"备注\" (notes) field in the table can hold this information, but we need to populate it systematically for all existing records and make sure new entries get this analysis added too. I should explain how this analysis process works and ask whether they want me to review the other subjects' wrong topics and fill in diagnostic notes for those as well.","thinkingSignature":"a4966d259d739efb9c07478cd781e7a2ab277226fc2815f209301de29333ce23"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 好问题！其实其它科目也可以用同样的方式做薄弱点分析。\n\n---\n\n**现在的情况：**\n\n旧数据里各科错题已经有「错因分析」和「备注」字段，但分析比较简略（比如\"力学综合分析能力不足\"）。\n\n如果想做得更系统，可以做两件事：\n\n---\n\n**第一：回溯分析现有记录**\n\n数学、物理、地理、历史、道法、语文的错题，每条补充：\n- 具体薄弱点是什么（不只是\"分析不到位\"）\n- 下次怎么避免\n- 推荐什么练习\n\n**第二：以后新录入时自动完成**\n\n以后每次录入新错题，AI 自动在「备注」里写好薄弱点诊断 + 推荐练习，不用手动整理。\n\n---\n\n**你希望我先做哪个？**\n\n- **A. 先把现有12条非英语错题全部补全薄弱点分析**（数学4条、物理2条、地理2条）\n- **B. 先确认各科的薄弱点分析框架**（数学应该关注什么、物理应该关注什么），然后再补分析\n- **C. 先把方案定清楚** — 英语的\"词性转换/反身代词\"梳理得很细，其他科目你也想要类似细粒度吗？\n\n你倾向哪个？😄\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":524,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":143676,"totalTokens":144327,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0006288,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.0538785,"total":0.0545454}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774681735841,"responseId":"0616b18999d9c1db410a4f0f027335b2"}}
