{"type":"message","id":"d9c83f64","parentId":"5ac1e9e2","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:28:52.171Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"403 forbidden - I can't download it directly. Let me try with the drive file download endpoint instead. Actually, the file ID format looks like a Feishu file token. Let me try using the feishu_drive_file tool's download action, or try to get meta first.Actually, the URL is `/file/MTwSb0Z8ooBt9cxJjtackhwgnMh`. This might be a Feishu cloud file (not a doc). Let me try the feishu_fetch_doc tool since it can take a URL directly.Wait, actually this is a `/file/` URL, not a `/docx/` URL. \n\nLet me check what metadata I can retrieve about this file using the drive API.","thinkingSignature":"345d24787553e950fce30a494adcdbf393ee7d848f1031a3c70bc8de59afd2f7"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9e0fquagv75k_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"FULL_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null)\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(echo \"$FULL_TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\n\n# Try getting meta first\ncurl -s \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/metas/batch_query\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"request_docs\":[{\"doc_token\":\"MTwSb0Z8ooBt9cxJjtackhwgnMh\",\"doc_type\":\"file\"}]}'","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":117378,"output":374,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":146136,"cost":{"input":0.0352134,"output":0.00044879999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03736524}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774682922164,"responseId":"0616b62a5442abfd3e50004a152d8bef"}}
