{"type":"message","id":"3ad438dd","parentId":"412d7b32","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:29:23.812Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still 403. The issue is that the app doesn't have the `drive:drive` permission needed to download files.\n\nLet me try to use the Feishu OAuth to get more permissions. Actually, wait - maybe I should ask the user to share the file in a different way, or convert it to a public link, or share it as a Feishu doc that I can access.\n\nActually, let me think about what the user wants: they want me to read the article and then create a geography tutor skill. The article URL is a Feishu file. The issue is I can't download it due to permission restrictions.\n\nLet me ask the user to either:\n\n\n1. Share the content in another way (copy text, convert to a Feishu doc, etc.)\n2. Or authorize the app for drive permissions\n\nWait - let me also check if maybe this is a Feishu cloud document that can be accessed via the feishu_fetch_doc tool. But it's a `/file/` URL not a `/docx/` URL. Let me also try using the feishu_oauth tool to see if we can get more permissions.\n\nActually, let me try the feishu_im_user_get_messages approach to see if I can get the file through a message. Or maybe I should try using the tool to get the file in a different way.\n\nWait - maybe the user sent this as a Feishu file in the chat? Let me check if there's a message with this file attached. Looking at the inbound messages, I see the user sent a file link. Actually, in Feishu, when you send a file, it creates a message with an attachment. Let me search for recent messages to find this file.\n\nLet me try searching for the file in recent messages using feishu_im_user_search_messages or checking if there's a way to get the file from a message.\n\nActually, I should just ask the user to share the file content directly or convert it to a format I can access. The main constraint is that I need either a Feishu document I can fetch via API, a publicly accessible URL, or the text content sent directly to me. The file link isn't working due to permissions, so I'll ask the user for an alternative way to access the material.","thinkingSignature":"e8a395e0287c1ea8f2456db428618ba8339aebe2585f69082c4bdafb66bf5653"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 遇到权限问题了 😅\n\n这个文件是飞书云盘文件，下载需要 `drive:drive` 权限，但当前应用没有这个授权，所以直接下不了。\n\n**有几个解决方案：**\n\n**方案1（最快）：把文件内容转成文字发给我**\n- 在飞书里打开这个文件 → 全选复制 → 直接粘贴到对话框发给我\n- 我读完立刻开始创建 skill\n\n**方案2：发成飞书云文档链接**\n- 在飞书里把文件「转换为云文档」（右键 → 转为云文档）\n- 然后把新文档链接发给我\n\n**方案3：授权 drive 权限**\n- 在飞书开放平台给应用开通 drive 相关权限\n- 流程稍复杂，不着急\n\n---\n\n**方案1最快**，你试试？把文档内容直接发给我就行 📄\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118376,"output":651,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":147411,"cost":{"input":0.0355128,"output":0.0007812,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03799704}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774682943348,"responseId":"0616b63f67a7c9dbd431fdf7ca7aa4b0"}}
