{"type":"message","id":"181fa105","parentId":"769c1fc3","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:56:41.230Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ayufzynlat3e_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片是《义务教育生物学课程标准（2022年版）》的封面，并非地理复习资料。以下是图片中包含的所有文字信息：\n\n**页面中心内容：**\n1.  **上方文字：** 义务教育\n2.  **主标题：** 生物学课程标准\n3.  **副标题：** （2022年版）\n4.  **制定单位：** 中华人民共和国教育部制定\n\n**页面下方出版信息：**\n*   **Logo：** 北京师范大学出版社的图标\n*   **机构名称：** 北京师范大学出版集团 (BEIJING NORMAL UNIVERSITY PUBLISHING GROUP)\n*   **出版社名称：** 北京师范大学出版社\n\n**补充说明：**\n根据封面文字，这是一份关于**生物学**的教学指导文件，由国家教育部发布。如果您需要地理相关的资料，可能需要寻找标题为“地理课程标准”或“地理复习资料”的书籍。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/tmp/geo2_page1.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774684601210}}
{"type":"message","id":"38e57eb5","parentId":"181fa105","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:56:53.696Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent a Biology curriculum standard PDF, not Geography. But wait, the filename says \"初中地理总复习课程标准\"... Let me check - the filename encoding is garbled. The image tool identified it as Biology curriculum. Let me check the filename more carefully.\n\nActually looking at the garbled filename \"æ_è_²é_ç_ç_è_¾ç_ä¹_å_æ_è_²å_çº²\" - this decodes to something like \"初中地理总复习课程\" based on the UTF-8 bytes visible. But the content is actually Biology curriculum standard.\n\nWait, the user said \"初中地理总复习课程标准\" in the garbled filename, but the image analysis says it's \"生物学课程标准\" (Biology curriculum standard). That's a big difference!\n \nSo the user's filename got corrupted during upload, and what's actually on disk appears to be the Biology standard, not Geography at all. I should clarify this mismatch with the user since they intended to share Geography materials.","thinkingSignature":"5ab5d0f58498c2536dae116c3a7ee634a89834ed9a185b70244b1412b26f4c10"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 这个 PDF 实际上是**《义务教育生物学课程标准（2022年版）》**的封面，不是地理 😅\n\n文件名编码出了问题，但内容我读到了——是生物课标，不是地理。\n\n---\n\n**请确认：**\n1. 这是生物资料发错了？\n2. 还是文件名乱码，实际你想发的是另一份地理资料？\n\n如果是地理资料，重新发一次链接我处理就好 📄\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":121102,"output":305,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":149791,"cost":{"input":0.0363306,"output":0.000366,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03839964}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774684601233,"responseId":"0616bcb9bccbb8ed6b05a7c584ff8ccd"}}
