{"type":"message","id":"6456fbb0","parentId":"5b970d06","timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:57:40.709Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Oh! 频哥实际上想要的是生物导师 skill，不是地理。文件名虽然写着\"地理\"但实际内容是生物学课程标准。我需要：\n\n1. 先读取生物课程标准的内容\n2. 参考语言学习导师 skill 的框架\n3. 创建初中生物导师 skill\n\n让我先把已经收到的生物课标 PDF 内容读一下，然后创建 skill。","thinkingSignature":"41a07781104d2e1cc49a37ff5067612749aefe959e49756accda11308ebaeda4"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先把生物课标的内容读进来，再创建生物导师 skill：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nohpr6hslujj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"for i in 1 2 3 4 5 6; do\n  sips -s format png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/æ_è_²é_ç_ç_è_¾ç_ä¹_å_æ_è_²å_çº²---c524adee-5abe-4b37-8de7-3b64a7605a8c.pdf\" --out \"/tmp/bio_page${i}.png\" 2>/dev/null\ndone\necho \"done\"","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":240,"cacheRead":148335,"cacheWrite":1372,"totalTokens":150074,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.000288,"cacheRead":0.0089001,"cacheWrite":0.0005145,"total":0.009740699999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774684651630,"responseId":"0616bced94706bc7ab171aa4ee31d579"}}
