{"type":"message","id":"7d130bed","parentId":"de2b6807","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:03:53.715Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All pages have the same file size (72009 bytes), which strongly suggests this is a scanned PDF where all pages look the same (like a scanned book where each page was scanned as an image). This is a common issue with PDFs that are scanned images rather than text-based PDFs.\n\nIn this case, my image analysis tool can't read the content because:\n1. Each \"page\" is actually just the cover page being repeatedly shown\n2. The actual content pages might be embedded differently or not at all\n\nI need to be honest with the user that I cannot read this PDF properly because it appears to be a scanned/image-based PDF where the content isn't in a readable text format.\n\nActually wait - if all pages are exactly the same size (72009 bytes), it's almost certainly a template/cover PDF where the same image is repeated. This is likely not the actual content the user intended to share.\n\n\nI should let the user know what's happening with this file and ask them to either share it in a different format or point me to the actual content source.","thinkingSignature":"e982b6b4cd564e76ce6992fae125478e9ce3f51b4fe396810787fd69c2a030af"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 试过了，还是读不了 😅\n\n**原因：** 这个 PDF 是扫描/图像版 PDF，所有页面转换出来都是相同大小（72009字节），说明每一页其实是同一张封面图重复，不是真正的内容页。\n\n---\n\n**你能这样帮我：**\n\n1. **在飞书里打开这份 PDF**\n2. **全选里面的文字内容**（Ctrl+A → Ctrl+C）\n3. **直接粘贴到这里发给我**\n\n或者如果有 Word/TXT 版本的复习资料，把里面的内容发给我也行。\n\n这样我就能真正读完你手里的资料，再来创建 skill，而不是用我自己的知识储备来凑 💪\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":130803,"output":354,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":159541,"cost":{"input":0.039240899999999995,"output":0.00042479999999999997,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04136874}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774685020689,"resp