{"type":"message","id":"d754cf22","parentId":"d08cda67","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:19:34.817Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is pointing out that the Chinese text in the generated image is garbled/mojibake. This is a common issue with image generation models - they often can't render Chinese characters properly. \n\nSolutions:\n1. Generate the image without Chinese text, just use visual elements\n2. Use English text instead (but that defeats the purpose for a Chinese student)\n3. Post-process the image to add proper Chinese labels using image editing\n4. Use a different approach - generate an image without text labels, and then describe the labels separately\n\nThe best solution is to generate images with visual elements (arrows, icons, chemical formulas in standard notation) rather than Chinese text, and then add the Chinese labels separately in the text of the questions.\n\n\nI'll regenerate the image using chemical formulas like CO₂ and H₂O instead of Chinese characters, keeping the labels minimal so the text is clearer.","thinkingSignature":"d2a5083b634dfb57f72d2883981f3ef20a45504dc6d623cdfde9d6677add53ff"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 确实，AI 生成图片对中文支持很差，中文会变成乱码/方块。解决方案有两个：\n\n---\n\n**方案一（推荐）：图片用化学符号，题目用中文描述**\n\n生成图片时不画中文标签，改用国际通用的化学符号和箭头，题目里再用中文引导孩子看图：\n\n```\n[图片内容描述]\n- 太阳符号 ☀️ → 表示 光照\n- 箭头指向植物 → 表示 CO₂ 进入\n- 箭头从植物出 → 表示 O₂ 释放  \n- 底部管道 → 表示 H₂O 进入\n- 植物体内箭头 → 表示生成有机物\n```\n\n**方案二：用 ASCII 字符画图（绝对准确）**\n\n```\n       ☀️ 光\n        ↓\n   ┌─────────┐\nCO₂→│ 叶绿体  │→O₂\n   │  ~~~   │\n   └────┬────┘\n        ↓\n       H₂O\n    （根部吸水）\n```\n\n方案二的图是纯文本，完全准确，但视觉效果不如方案一的 AI 图。\n\n---\n\n**建议：** 以后出题用**方案一**——AI 图配中文题目描述，图片里不放中文。这样图片好看，题目也清晰。\n\n要不要我用方案一重新生成一张无中文标签的光合作用图？🌿\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":461,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":133783,"totalTokens":162755,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0005532,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0.050168625,"total":0.052462965}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774685952688,"responseId":"0616c20191bdc9fed9ad3662bf767c56"}}
