{"type":"message","id":"0955e91f","parentId":"91b90c4d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:22:37.061Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_zjuwq6ifej35_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示了一个关于植物生理过程（如光合作用）的示意图，包含太阳、一株植物、根系以及一些文字和符号。\n\n根据您的要求，这张图片中存在大量**乱码、显示异常的中文以及看不懂的符号**。具体表现如下：\n\n1.  **乱码与伪字符：**\n    *   **左侧橙色圆圈内：** 上方的字符像是一个变形的“吉”或“告”，但笔画明显错误；下方的“иро”看起来像西里尔字母，但在该语境下毫无意义。\n    *   **右侧橙色圆圈内：** 上方的字符是生造的，类似“立”和“庄”的结合体；中间有极小且模糊、无法辨认的英文字母（类似“gieontiod”）；下方是“3PL”加上一些多余的线条。\n\n2.  **语义不通的中文：**\n    *   **图片右侧中部：** 竖排排列着六个汉字“**矛尘茫日楼回**”。虽然这些是标准汉字，但组合在一起完全没有意义，不符合科学示意图的表达方式。\n\n3.  **错误的科学符号/术语：**\n    *   **左侧：** “**HB°e**” 不是标准的化学或物理符号。下方的“**CO**”在光合作用图中通常应为 $CO_2$（二氧化碳）。\n    *   **植物根部上方：** “**02G**” 看起来是想表达 $O_2$（氧气），但书写完全错误。\n    *   **右侧下方：** “**H2O**” 中的“2”没有下标，虽然能看懂是水，但不符合正规书写规范。\n\n**总结：** 这张图片明显是由AI生成的，虽然构图模仿了科学示意图，但其中的文字和符号内容全都是随机生成的错误信息、伪字符或乱码。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/photosynthesis_clean---44613f2f-203a-4897-b12c-bd695e1125c9.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774686157047}}
{"type":"message","id":"49bf58ce","parentId":"0955e91f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:22:54.455Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"As I suspected - the image generation model still includes Chinese characters that get garbled, along with incorrect chemical symbols. The issue is that AI image generation models have difficulty rendering text and chemical formulas accurately in images.\n\nThe better approach is to:\n1. Generate an image WITHOUT any text/symbols at all - just a simple visual representation\n2. Or use ASCII art which is guaranteed to be accurate\n3. Or use a purely visual diagram without any text\n\nLet me suggest using a pure visual approach where the image is just visual elements (sun, plant, arrows) without any text labels, and then use the text description to explain what each element represents. This avoids the garbled text problem entirely.\n\n\nI'll regenerate with an even more minimal prompt that strips away all text and symbols entirely, leaving just the visual representation of the photosynthesis process.","thinkingSignature":"7eb27e9bae29d58f2fa27488cd8ba8b28320c96d8bdb882e44f91f9a5685ee8c"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 看来 AI 生成图片对**任何文字**支持都很差——即使 prompt 里没写中文，模型还是会往里塞文字符号，结果乱七八糟 😅\n\n**彻底解决方案：**\n\n图里完全不出现任何文字/符号，只有纯视觉元素。题目里用**编号对应**的方式来引导：\n\n```\n图示：\n🌞（太阳，用光线连接）\n🌿（植物，带叶片和根）\n→→→（箭头）\n```\n\n我来重新生成一张**纯视觉、无任何文字**的图 👇\n\n</final>\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cq4n1occklxm_1","name":"image_generate","arguments":{"prompt":"Minimalist scientific illustration of photosynthesis process for middle school biology. ONLY visual elements with NO text, NO words, NO labels, NO chemical formulas. Pure white background. Elements: 1) Yellow sun with light rays at top 2) Green plant cross-section in center with visible leaf cells 3) Left side: arrow pointing INTO leaf 4) Right side: arrow pointing OUT from leaf 5) Bottom: arrow pointing UP into roots 6) Inside leaf: small circles representing glucose being produced. All arrows should have simple arrowheads. Colors: sun=yellow, plant=green, roots=brown, arrows=black. Educational diagram style. NO text anywhere in the image. Simple and clean.","filename":"photosynthesis_purevisual"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":133616,"output":465,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":162465,"cost":{"input":0.0400848,"output":0.000558,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04234584}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774686157064,"responseId":"0616c2cd6a1c62bf57bc66eb8a041cc5"}}
