{"type":"message","id":"e9b3f295","parentId":"eb59a3f4","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:23:36.350Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_eb0p22097vj5_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This image is a simplified, schematic illustration of a plant growing, set against a solid white background. The diagram consists of three main visual sections: a sun at the top, a green plant in the middle, and a cross-section of soil and roots at the bottom.\n\nStarting from the top:\n*   **The Sun:** A bright yellow circle centered at the top of the image, surrounded by eight thin yellow lines representing rays of light. Beneath the sun, a short arrow points downward toward the plant. Above this arrow is a small text label containing garbled characters that appear to be **\"BHNW16\"**.\n*   **The Plant:** A single vertical green stem with seven green leaves. The leaves are almond-shaped with pointed tips and a simple line down the middle. One leaf is at the very top, with three pairs of leaves branching off the stem below it.\n*   **The Soil and Roots:** At the base of the plant is a brown circular area representing soil. Inside this circle, there are lighter brown irregular shapes representing rocks or clumps of earth. The green stem enters this soil and branches into a few small green roots. Extending below the soil circle are several thinner, tangled yellow lines representing deeper roots.\n\nAround the base of the plant, several arrows point toward the soil area, each with a text label. Most of these labels consist of garbled or nonsensical text:\n*   **Top Left:** An arrow points down and to the right toward the soil. The label reads: **\"IIKIGFLIDE\"**.\n*   **Bottom Left:** An arrow points right toward the soil. The label reads: **\"LOTFUA\"**.\n*   **Top Right:** An arrow points down and to the left toward the soil. The label reads: **\"SITINE\"**.\n*   **Bottom Right:** An arrow points left toward the soil. The label reads: **\"CUITUA\"**.\n*   **Bottom Center:** An arrow points upward from the very bottom toward the yellow roots. The label below this arrow reads: **\"ROOTS\"**.\n\nThere are no Chinese characters present in the image. Most of the labels appear to be randomly generated or garbled letter strings, with the exception of the word \"ROOTS\" at the bottom."}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/photosynthesis_purevisual---b9048166-6567-4afa-b429-6190ae9907da.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774686216337}}
{"type":"message","id":"3398e007","parentId":"e9b3f295","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:23:57.714Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still has garbled text labels (IIKIGFLIDE, LOTFUA, SITINE, CUITUA) and the word \"ROOTS\" at the bottom. The AI image generation model just can't handle NOT having text in scientific diagrams - it always tries to add labels.\n\nThis is a fundamental limitation of the image generation model. Let me be honest with the user and suggest a completely different approach - using ASCII art which is guaranteed to be accurate and clean.\n\nASCII art is actually the best approach for biology diagrams because:\n1. It can be precise\n2. It can show exact structures\n3. No garbled text issue\n4. Can be styled nicely\n\nOr alternatively, the user could draw simple diagrams by hand and take photos, which would be the most practical approach.\n\nLet me suggest ASCII art as the practical solution.","thinkingSignature":"ebd4ef4655e717ade7b87054586cf6be729e0ea012adf3efec0027d17a9e1c72"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 确认了，AI 生成图片**天生爱往图里塞文字**，再怎么 prompt 都拦不住 😅\n\n**真正靠谱的方案：用 ASCII 字符画图**\n\n纯文本，准确无误，而且可以画得很清晰：\n\n```\n         ☀️\n          │\n          ▼\n    ┌─────────────┐\n    │   🍃 叶肉    │ ← CO₂ 从左侧气孔进入\n    │   细胞       │    O₂ 从右侧气孔释放\n    │  ╭───────╮  │\n    │  │叶绿体  │  │  ← 产生有机物（葡萄糖）\n    │  ╰───────╯  │\n    └─────┬───────┘\n          │\n      ┌───┴───┐\n      │  💧   │  ← 根部吸收水分和无机盐\n      └───────┘\n```\n\n**以后出生物图题，统一用这个方案：**\n- 我用 ASCII 字符画结构图\n- 题目里用编号/箭头指向来提问\n- 孩子看图例说明理解\n\n这套方法在我输出里完全准确，不会出现乱码。\n\n要试试吗？我用 ASCII 图出一道\"细胞结构\"题给你看看效果？🔬\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":133636,"output":442,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":162462,"cost":{"input":0.040090799999999996,"output":0.0005304,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04232424}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774686216353,"resp