{"type":"message","id":"05228fb5","parentId":"a1ccffa8","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:27:46.924Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ue5nv733u5o3_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This image is a stylized, educational-style diagram illustrating the process of photosynthesis. It features a large, central green leaf positioned between the sun at the top and a root system at the bottom. The sun emits a triangular beam of light that focuses on the leaf.\n\nThere is **no Chinese text** in the image. However, there are several **garbled characters and typos**, particularly inside the leaf and in some of the chemical labels. This level of distortion and nonsensical text is common in AI-generated imagery.\n\n### List of Text Labels:\n\n**Outside the leaf:**\n*   **SUN** (at the top, inside the sun icon)\n*   **CO₂** (top left, near an arrow pointing toward the leaf)\n*   **HO₂** (top right, near an arrow pointing toward the leaf; likely an AI typo for $H_2O$)\n*   **O₂** (bottom left, near an arrow pointing away from the leaf)\n*   **H₂₁** (bottom right, near an arrow pointing away from the leaf; garbled characters)\n\n**Inside the leaf (mostly garbled/nonsensical):**\n*   **LEAF₂₁**\n*   **(O TTES I)**\n*   **$DOD$O=BO**\n*   **GLLC6OGO**\n*   **CL6O8**\n*   **SUN**"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/tool-image-generation/bio_photosynthesis_en---b6b5ad97-02ef-407d-bbbb-1167767041db.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774686466910}}
