{"type":"message","id":"8a82f411","parentId":"97a2ed98","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:33:16.645Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user confirmed the image is now showing without garbled text. Great success! Now I have a working pipeline: SVG generation → PNG conversion → send to user. This can be automated for any biology diagram.\n\nLet me note this down in memory and also update the biology tutor skill to include this SVG-based diagram generation approach.","thinkingSignature":"1bc945d51052e5816dfca04dd3682c0914a6d724c6701fea72c125a5adcf1683"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 太好了 🎉\n\n**彻底解决了！**\n\n方案确认：\n- **SVG 画图**（我写代码）→ **QLManage 转 PNG**（macOS 内置工具）→ **发飞书**\n- 全程自动化，无乱码，标签清晰\n- 可以画任何生物结构图：细胞、光合作用、呼吸、消化系统、血液循环、反射弧…\n\n---\n\n**以后出图题流程：**\n```\n你说\"出XX练习题\" → 我生成SVG → 转PNG → 发给你 → 附上题目\n```\n\n我把这个方案更新到生物导师 skill 里，以后所有生物图题都用这个方法出 📊\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":213,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":135527,"totalTokens":164251,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0002556,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0.050822625,"total":0.052819365}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774686781632,"responseId":"0616c53fbfdc58e98bfe8c8f562c6a84"}}
