ENT id=\"c6b3d2a972922eda\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n《第五章中国四大地理区域划分》知识清单\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c6b3d2a972922eda\">>>","url":"https://word.baidu.com/view/86da359ccb50ad02de80d4d8d15abe23492f0300.html","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ebcd30cc51e14097\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n1、北方地区与南方地区分界线：秦岭—淮河一线，主导因素是气候（气温和降水）。 · 2、北方地区与西北地区分界线：400毫米年等降水量线，主导因素是降水。 · 3、青藏地区与\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"ebcd30cc51e14097\">>>","score":0.9997198}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774687206346}}
{"type":"message","id":"5a9669ca","parentId":"843f4dac","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:40:28.569Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search results are mostly pointing to Baidu Wenku and other document sites that I can't easily scrape images from. Let me try to search for a direct image URL for China's four geographic regions map.\n\nActually, I should be honest with the user. Finding a specific high-quality, copyright-free geography map image that I can reliably download and use is difficult. The web search approach isn't giving me a clean image URL I can directly use.\n\nLet me think about what options I really have:\n1. Web search for image URLs - hit or miss, mostly can't access due to restrictions\n2. SVG drawing - accurate for biology (structural diagrams) but not for geography (geographical accuracy)\n3. AI image generation - has text rendering problems\n\n\n4. The user's own photos of textbooks - most reliable\n\nFor geography, I really need to be honest that I cannot reliably find and download the specific accurate maps needed without the user providing them. I should suggest the user provide real maps from textbooks, OR I should use my SVG skills more carefully to create a geographically accurate map (even if simplified) rather than claiming I can find one online. I could try to create a more geographically accurate SVG map using known coordinates and boundaries.","thinkingSignature":"b2bf9f3fdf0dcc6e9a94ce11dedd763733253595192fcabd5ff796898124003a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 坦白说，有难度 😅\n\n网络搜索能找到地图资源，但面临几个问题：\n- 很多地图网站有防盗链，直接下载会 403\n- 搜索结果大多是百度文库/知乎链接，图片拿不到\n- 没有版权的教材原图很难找\n\n---\n\n**我可以做到的：**\n\n用 SVG 画一张**简化但地理要素准确**的中国四大分区图——边界、位置、主要城市都用标准坐标来画，比手绘的精确很多。\n\n我之前那张的问题是把省份边界画得太随意了。\n\n---\n\n**还是推荐这个方案：**\n\n你把孩子的**地理教材/习题册**里现有的地图页拍照发给我，我在那张真实地图上出题——地理位置 100% 准确，而且自动化程度一样高：\n\n```\n你发教材地图照片 → 我识别 → 出题 → 发给你\n```\n\n你只需要拍一张就行，其他我来处理 📸\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":131902,"output":442,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":160728,"cost":{"input":0.0395706,"output":0.0005304,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04180404}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774687206363,"responseId":"0616c6e64efe57df83c3f913a1f7a60c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"486bbd1e","parentId":"5a9669ca","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:41:36.559Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 16:41:35 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b534d0d2364b0c49f4bf08816c27]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b534d0d2364b0c49f4bf08816c27\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 16:41 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n你先试试第一个方案我看看"}],"timestamp":1774687296531}}
{"type":"message","id":"febee06a","parentId":"486bbd1e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T08:42:46.679Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to try the first option - drawing a more geographically accurate SVG map of China's four regions. Let me create a much better SVG with more accurate positioning of the boundaries and key cities.\n\nI need to think about what makes a geographically accurate representation:\n\n1. Qinghai-Tibet Plateau - western part of China, roughly from 73°E to 100°E, 28°N to 36°N\n2. Northwest region - roughly 73°E to 110°E, 35°N to 50°N  \n3. Northern region (北方) - roughly east-central China, 100°E to 130°E, 30°N to 45°N\n\n\n4. Southern region (南方) - roughly 100°E to 130°E, 20°N to 35°N\n\nI should also include the major geographic markers: the Qinling-Huaihe Line as the key boundary around 34°N, the 400mm isohyet marking the northwest boundary, the plateau edge marking the Qinghai-Tibet boundary, and important cities like Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou, Chengdu, Xi'an, Lanzhou, and Ürümqi positioned appropriately. Now I'll refine the SVG to better capture these spatial relationships and geographic features.\n\nFor the SVG coordinates on an 800x600 canvas, I need to account for how China's actual geography compresses the western regions and expands the eastern seaboard due to the conical projection effect. Rather than using a linear projection, I'll focus on representing the relative positions of the major geographic zones as accurately as possible, accepting some distortion as inherent to any flat representation.","thinkingSignature":"76bc820653ab643f997bba215890c3659721943ab8ef917af0d383832e2994fb"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7io5zqi2cnnr_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 650\">\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"650\" fill=\"#f5f9ff\"/>\n\n  <!-- Title -->\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"25\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\" font-weight=\"bold\">中国四大地理分区</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#555\">Four Major Geographic Regions of China</text>\n\n  <!-- === Four Geographic Regions (simplified accurate positions) === -->\n\n  <!-- 青藏地区: western plateau, northern border ~昆仑山-阿尔金山-祁连山, ~28N-40N, 73E-100E -->\n  <path d=\"M100,140 L300,120 L450,130 L500,200 L480,280 L400,340 L320,360 L240,340 L160,280 L100,200 Z\"\n        fill=\"#c8e6c9\" stroke=\"#388e3c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1b5e20\" font-weight=\"bold\">青藏地区</text>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1b5e20\">Qinghai-Tibet</text>\n  <text x=\"280\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#2e7d32\">高寒牧场/河谷农业</text>\n\n  <!-- 西北地区: north-central, roughly north of 35N, east of 100E to 120E -->\n  <path d=\"M100,200 L160,280 L240,340 L320,360 L380,380 L360,460 L280,490 L180,470 L100,400 Z\"\n        fill=\"#ffe0b2\" stroke=\"#e65100\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#bf360c\" font-weight=\"bold\">西北地区</text>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"388\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#bf360c\">Northwest</text>\n  <text x=\"230\" y=\"402\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#d84315\">干旱/灌溉农业/绿洲</text>\n\n  <!-- 北方地区: ~秦岭-淮河线以北, east of 100E -->\n  <path d=\"M320,360 L400,340 L480,280 L580,300 L620,370 L600,440 L520,480 L420,490 L360,460 L380,380 Z\"\n        fill=\"#bbdefb\" stroke=\"#1565c0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"470\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#0d47a1\" font-weight=\"bold\">北方地区</text>\n  <text x=\"470\" y=\"413\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#0d47a1\">Northern China</text>\n  <text x=\"470\" y=\"427\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#1565c0\">旱地农业/温带季风</text>\n\n  <!-- 南方地区: ~秦岭-淮河线以南 -->\n  <path d=\"M480,280 L580,300 L620,370 L650,430 L640,520 L580,570 L500,580 L420,550 L400,480 L420,490 L520,480 L600,440 Z\"\n        fill=\"#a5d6a7\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"530\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1b5e20\" font-weight=\"bold\">南方地区</text>\n  <text x=\"530\" y=\"458\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1b5e20\">Southern China</text>\n  <text x=\"530\" y=\"472\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#2e7d32\">水田农业/亚热带热带</text>\n\n  <!-- === Boundaries (dashed lines) === -->\n\n  <!-- 青藏地区北界: 昆仑山-阿尔金山-祁连山 -->\n  <path d=\"M100,200 L160,280 L240,340 L320,360\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7b1fa2\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/>\n  <text x=\"175\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#7b1fa2\" font-weight=\"bold\">昆仑山-阿尔金山-祁连山</text>\n  <text x=\"175\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#7b1fa2\">（青藏地区北界）</text>\n\n  <!-- 秦岭-淮河线: ~34N -->\n  <path d=\"M100,340 L500,320 L620,340 L700,380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c62828\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"8,4\"/>\n  <text x=\"580\" y=\"308\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#c62828\" font-weight=\"bold\">秦岭—淮河线</text>\n  <text x=\"580\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#c62828\">~34°N / 800mm等降水量线</text>\n\n  <!-- 西北地区北界: 400mm等降水量线 -->\n  <path d=\"M100,140 L280,120 L450,130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6f00\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"250\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#ff6f00\">400mm等降水量线</text>\n\n  <!-- === Key Cities === -->\n  <!-- 北京 (北方) -->\n  <circle cx=\"520\" cy=\"350\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#d32f2f\"/>\n  <text x=\"530\" y=\"344\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"bold\">北京</text>\n  <text x=\"530\" y=\"355\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#666\">Beijing</text>\n\n  <!-- 上海 (南方) -->\n  <circle cx=\"610\" cy=\"470\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1976d2\"/>\n  <text x=\"620\" y=\"464\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"bold\">上海</text>\n  <text x=\"620\" y=\"475\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#666\">Shanghai</text>\n\n  <!-- 广州 (南方) -->\n  <circle cx=\"580\" cy=\"545\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1976d2\"/>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"539\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"bold\">广州</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"8\" fill=\"#666\">Guangzhou</text>\n\n  <!-- 成都 (青藏边缘) -->\n  <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"320\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#7b1fa2\"/>\n  <text x=\"410\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">成都</text>\n\n  <!-- 西安 (北方-秦岭淮河附近) -->\n  <circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"320\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#c62828\"/>\n  <text x=\"480\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">西安</text>\n\n  <!-- 乌鲁木齐 (西北) -->\n  <circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"220\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#e65100\"/>\n  <text x=\"180\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">乌鲁木齐</text>\n\n  <!-- 拉萨 (青藏) -->\n  <circle cx=\"290\" cy=\"270\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#2e7d32\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">拉萨</text>\n\n  <!-- 哈尔滨 (北方) -->\n  <circle cx=\"570\" cy=\"240\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#1565c0\"/>\n  <text x=\"580\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">哈尔滨</text>\n\n  <!-- === Legend === -->\n  <rect x=\"620\" y=\"120\" width=\"165\" height=\"175\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#ccc\" rx=\"8\"/>\n  <text x=\"640\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"bold\">图例 Legend</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"630\" y=\"152\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#c8e6c9\" stroke=\"#388e3c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"163\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">青藏地区</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"630\" y=\"170\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#ffe0b2\" stroke=\"#e65100\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"181\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">西北地区</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"630\" y=\"188\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#bbdefb\" stroke=\"#1565c0\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"199\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">北方地区</text>\n\n  <rect x=\"630\" y=\"206\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#a5d6a7\" stroke=\"#2e7d32\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\">南方地区</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"630\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"648\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#c62828\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#c62828\">秦岭-淮河线</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"630\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"648\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#7b1fa2\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"254\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#7b1fa2\">青藏北界</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"630\" y1=\"268\" x2=\"648\" y2=\"268\" stroke=\"#ff6f00\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,3\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#ff6f00\">400mm等降水线</text>\n\n  <circle cx=\"639\" cy=\"285\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#d32f2f\"/>\n  <text x=\"653\" y=\"289\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#333\">省会城市</text>\n\n  <!-- Compass -->\n  <g transform=\"translate(700,580)\">\n    <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"18\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <text x=\"0\" y=\"-6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"bold\">N</text>\n    <path d=\"M0,-12 L3,-2 L0,-6 L-3,-2 Z\" fill=\"#333\"/>\n    <path d=\"M0,12 L3,2 L0,6 L-3,2 Z\" fill=\"#ccc\"/>\n    <text x=\"0\" y=\"4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"7\" fill=\"#666\">S</text>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n","file":"/tmp/china_geo_regions.svg"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":3026,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":132063,"totalTokens":163600,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0036312,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0.049523625,"total":0.054895965000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774687296559,"responseId":"0616c742588269178977e79ca331e921"}}
