{"type":"message","id":"49bbe690","parentId":"6341c23b","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:40:58.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All 9 years are now covered (2016, 2017, 2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024). Let me give a final summary.","thinkingSignature":"3aad7cd91d8232ea91133f16a4be5c2cf2b36b830c2b0ca90ab531b75440099a"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 搞定 ✅\n\n**2020年成都中考地理（最后一份）**\n\n核心考点：\n- 🗺️ 既陆上相邻又隔海相望：越南、朝鲜\n- 🌲 台湾特有树种：红桧\n- ⏰ 东西时差原因：我国东西跨经度大\n- 🌏 珠峰测量（2020.5.27）：太阳直射赤道与北回归线之间\n- 🦬 青藏高原：高寒、牦牛\n\n---\n\n**地理 skill 收录完成（9年全覆盖）：**\n\n| 年份 | 状态 |\n|------|:-----:|\n| 2016 | ✅ |\n| 2017 | ✅ |\n| 2018 | ✅ |\n| 2019 | ✅ |\n| 2020 | ✅ |\n| 2021 | ✅ |\n| 2022 | ✅ |\n| 2023 | ✅ |\n| 2024 | ✅ |\n\n---\n\n**历年高频考点总结：**\n- 🐧 南极科考站（几乎每年）\n- 🌍 地球运动/公转/自转（每年都有）\n- 🗺️ 秦岭淮河一线（高频）\n- 🏜️ 黄土高原/水土流失（多次）\n- 🇨🇳 北京城市职能（多次）\n- 🌊 长江/黄河（多次）\n- 🌾 四大地理分区（核心）\n\n地理导师 skill 已准备就绪，随时可以出题/辅导 🌸\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":48647,"output":370,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":77401,"cost":{"input":0.014594099999999999,"output":0.000444,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.016741139999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774708848198,"responseId":"06171b70540886d9661f8552bb9e9686"}}
