{"type":"message","id":"36724edd","parentId":"149a22ab","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:43:05.265Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to enter this question into the 错题本 (error notebook) bitable. I need to:\n1. Recognize the question: It's a geography question about 青稞 (highland barley) and 糌粑 (tsampa)\n2. The metadata shows: Subject=地理, Topic=特色美食与农作物, Answer=A, Error reason=不知道青稞是青藏高原特产，糌粑是藏族主食\n3. Add it to the bitable\n\nLet me create a record in the bitable with the relevant fields.","thinkingSignature":"ce331357147305e57f64af88a34b81bfb7188f8952c57d31bcce5d2c0854264e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4zpf8lr9if9d_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"create","app_token":"TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1","table_id":"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz","fields":{"错因分析":"不知道青稞是青藏高原特产，糌粑是藏族主食","原图":[{"file_token":""}],"学科":"地理","录入时间":1743256800000,"难度":"⭐","知识点":["青藏高原","农业与饮食","中国地理分区"],"正确答案":"A. 糌粑","题目内容":"25. 以青稞为原料制作的当地特色美食是（ ）\nA. ① 糌粑\nB. ② 米线\nC. ③ 馕饼\nD. ④ 凉皮\n\n解析：青稞是青藏高原（西藏、青海）的主要农作物，糌粑是藏族同胞的主食。米线以大米为原料（云南）；馕饼以小麦粉为原料（新疆）；凉皮以小麦粉或大米粉为原料（陕西、甘肃）。"}}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":402,"cacheRead":77556,"cacheWrite":1210,"totalTokens":79295,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00048239999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00465336,"cacheWrite":0.00045375,"total":0.00562761}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774708976157,"responseId":"06171bf00c221a8ee32163bb2a17070f"}}
