{"type":"message","id":"fb91a46c","parentId":"f6d268ad","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:45:43.985Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The web fetch didn't return useful content. Let me try a different approach - maybe the issue is with the `file_type` field. In the Feishu API, for images, `file_type` should typically be `image`. But maybe for bitable specifically, the type mapping is different.\n\nLet me try with `file_type=jpeg`:","thinkingSignature":"b6b98af901917f91d769603a6dc4f2785466d9eb6b204fd46ae8f9d379cd7b1c"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_m26q86bc5lfl_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s 'openclaw-feishu-uat' -a 'cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83' -w 2>/dev/null | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=json.loads(sys.stdin.read()); print(d.get(\"accessToken\",\"\"))')\n\n# Try with file_type=jpeg\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${TOKEN}\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=geography_q25.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"file_type=jpeg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\",\"fieldId\":\"fld2F4ad3r\",\"recordId\":\"recvfaO6GVjeG4\"}}' \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/geography_q25.jpg;type=image/jpeg\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":60480,"output":364,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89228,"cost":{"input":0.018144,"output":0.0004368,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02028384}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709135308,"responseId":"06171c8f236b0c5b2040cbc146715ed4"}}
