{"type":"message","id":"a6f9f0fe","parentId":"86442f1d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:48:49.230Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Same error with mypermspace too. This is strange. The API is consistently returning \"params error\" for all upload attempts. \n\nWait - looking at this more carefully, I notice that in the curl case I was getting \"params error\" but the Python case initially gave \"Invalid access token\" before the token was fixed. But both are now giving \"params error\".\n\nLet me check: is the token perhaps getting URL-encoded or having some character issue in the shell heredoc? Actually wait - looking at the Python urllib approach, the error \"Invalid access token\" appeared when I hardcoded a truncated token in the Python script. When I use the shell variable ${TOKEN} it works (i.e., gets a response, just an error one).\n \nBoth approaches are hitting the same params error, which makes me wonder if Feishu's API requires the file upload to come from an allowed source IP or domain. But that doesn't quite make sense for their public API. Let me reconsider the curl command itself - I'm using -F flags for each field, which should work, but maybe I need to verify the Content-Type header is being set correctly.\n\nActually, I think the issue might be with how curl handles the file field when you use -F with @ - the filename in the Content-Disposition header might not be formatted correctly for their API. Let me try specifying the filename explicitly in the -F flag instead.","thinkingSignature":"dbf82ac51070bdafd26d8f46e95e272036d854e5724921255ef56839fc5bf5f6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_yctbrppfnmmg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s 'openclaw-feishu-uat' -a 'cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83' -w 2>/dev/null | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=json.loads(sys.stdin.read()); print(d.get(\"accessToken\",\"\"))')\n\n# Try curl with explicit Content-Type for the file part  \ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${TOKEN}\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=geography_q25.jpg; filename*=UTF-8''geography_q25.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"file_type=image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tblJ7fKHxchaECKz\",\"fieldId\":\"fld2F4ad3r\",\"recordId\":\"recvfaO6GVjeG4\"}}' \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/geography_q25.jpg;type=image/jpeg;filename=geography_q25.jpg\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":69517,"output":602,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98503,"cost":{"input":0.020855099999999998,"output":0.0007224,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02328054}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709313674,"responseId":"06171d4147008ab4354f23f88c00b335"}}
