{"type":"message","id":"0c70e714","parentId":"ed3bd653","timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:59:05.230Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's the node SDK. Let me try to write a small script that uses the SDK to upload the file.\n\nActually, let me think about this differently. The issue with the curl approach was `code: 1061002, \"params error\"`. This is a Feishu API error that says the parameters are wrong.\n\nLooking at the successful call in the summary:\n- endpoint: `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all`\n- parent_type: `bitable_image`\n- parent_node: app_token\n- extra: `{\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"xxx\"}}`\n\nBut the doc-media.js code shows it uses `parent_type: parentType` without specifying \"bitable_image\" explicitly. \n\nI need to check what parentType is actually set to in the bitable_upload function.","thinkingSignature":"9cca9820e0968f3cd86c208ffd6bd505ffe19f968a0d683e019f5fb6b0e007e2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n3z662xjw93r_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"parentType\\|parent_type\" /Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/src/tools/oapi/drive/doc-media.js | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":75467,"output":231,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104082,"cost":{"input":0.0226401,"output":0.00027719999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024620339999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774709937753,"responseId":"06171fb261304a8ffe7fc817f999987b"}}
