{"type":"message","id":"b70e4588","parentId":"78e75003","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:00:11.027Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The record has been updated with the file token. Now the attachment field is populated with the uploaded image. The issue was with how the Content-Length was being calculated in the previous curl attempts - the binary file content wasn't being counted correctly.","thinkingSignature":"ca2ba750966b1980e8a6dde8bc678351e5f2b9ba3e2d40c73e74f4ed02aecfc5"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 搞定 ✅ \n\n**上传成功！** 之前失败的原因是 `Content-Length` 计算不对（二进制内容长度没算准）。\n\n**完整录入结果：**\n- ✅ 文字内容 + 答案已录入\n- ✅ 原图附件已上传并关联到记录\n\n**记录 ID**：`recvfaO6GVjeG4`（地理·青稞糌粑·青藏高原）\n\n---\n\n抱歉让你等了，原因是 Node.js  Buffer 二进制拼接时 Content-Length 计算有偏差，换了个方式算准了就通了 🌸\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":78403,"output":174,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106961,"cost":{"input":0.023520899999999997,"output":0.00020879999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025432739999999995}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774710003872,"responseId":"06171ff4889b203925e055b9b51dc6ef"}}
{"type":"message","id":"8575ed58","parentId":"b70e4588","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:06:27.128Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 23:06:25 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b534aa9d96538c221b44579fe9de]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b534aa9d96538c221b44579fe9de\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 23:06 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n那你复盘和总结一下这个经验"}],"timestamp":1774710387122}}
{"type":"message","id":"937756fa","parentId":"8575ed58","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:06:48.039Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to summarize the lessons learned from today's debugging experience with the Feishu file upload API. Let me compile the key insights from the entire day of troubleshooting.","thinkingSignature":"555a30bcb42acf6c283a887d1534574010c23eaf1873d1f65fda9c2fdd33bd6f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_08k4rohbl87y_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-28.md","oldString":"详见 MEMORY.md 完整记录。","newString":"详见 MEMORY.md 完整记录。\n\n---\n\n## 附件上传 API 调试经验（2026-03-28 晚）\n\n**问题：**\n调用 `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all` 上传图片到 bitable 附件字段，API 始终返回 `code: 1061002 params error`。\n\n**根本原因：**\nNode.js  Buffer 拼接 multipart body 时，二进制文件内容长度计算不准。代码：\n```\nBuffer.concat([headerBuf, fileBuf, trailerBuf])\n```\n而 `Content-Length` header 提前用 `Buffer.byteLength(body)` 计算，但 body 里的 `\\r\\n` 等于 2 字节，实际拼接后有细微差异。\n\n**最终解决方案（Node.js）：**\n```javascript\nconst headerBuf = Buffer.from(headerString, 'utf-8');\nconst fileBuf = fs.readFileSync(filePath);\nconst trailerBuf = Buffer.from(trailerString, 'utf-8');\nconst totalLen = headerBuf.length + fileBuf.length + trailerBuf.length;\n// 拼 Buffer 时也要用 Buffer.concat\nconst fullBody = Buffer.concat([headerBuf, fileBuf, trailerBuf]);\n```\n关键点：\n1. 先把 header 和 trailer 转成 Buffer，再和文件 Buffer 拼接\n2. 总长度分别计算后求和\n3. 不要用字符串拼接方式算 Content-Length\n\n**已验证成功的参数组合：**\n```\nfile_name: \"xxx.jpg\"\nfile_type: \"image\"\nparent_type: \"bitable_image\"\nparent_node: {app_token}\nsize: {文件字节数}\nextra: {\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"...\",\"fieldId\":\"...\",\"recordId\":\"...\"}}\nfile: [二进制文件内容]\nContent-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=...\nContent-Length: {totalLen}\n```\n\n**教训：**\n- multipart/form-data 的 Content-Length 必须和实际发送的 body 字节数完全一致\n- 二进制文件部分不能先转字符串再拼接，会破坏数据\n- 飞书 API 的 params error 有时是 Content-Length 不匹配，不是参数本身问题"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":538,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":103541,"totalTokens":104206,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0006456,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.038827875,"total":0.039511575}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774710387151,"responseId":"0617217464f0658df8adc2f2e2de85e1"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cf7d349f","parentId":"937756fa","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:06:48.084Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_08k4rohbl87y_1","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-28.md."}],"details":{"diff":"     ...\n  28 - parent_type:bitable_image(不是 bitable_file)\n  29 \n  30 详见 MEMORY.md 完整记录。\n  31 \n+ 32 ---\n+ 33 \n+ 34 ## 附件上传 API 调试经验（2026-03-28 晚）\n+ 35 \n+ 36 **问题：**\n+ 37 调用 `https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all` 上传图片到 bitable 附件字段，API 始终返回 `code: 1061002 params error`。\n+ 38 \n+ 39 **根本原因：**\n+ 40 Node.js  Buffer 拼接 multipart body 时，二进制文件内容长度计算不准。代码：\n+ 41 ```\n+ 42 Buffer.concat([headerBuf, fileBuf, trailerBuf])\n+ 43 ```\n+ 44 而 `Content-Length` header 提前用 `Buffer.byteLength(body)` 计算，但 body 里的 `\\r\\n` 等于 2 字节，实际拼接后有细微差异。\n+ 45 \n+ 46 **最终解决方案（Node.js）：**\n+ 47 ```javascript\n+ 48 const headerBuf = Buffer.from(headerString, 'utf-8');\n+ 49 const fileBuf = fs.readFileSync(filePath);\n+ 50 const trailerBuf = Buffer.from(trailerString, 'utf-8');\n+ 51 const totalLen = headerBuf.length + fileBuf.length + trailerBuf.length;\n+ 52 // 拼 Buffer 时也要用 Buffer.concat\n+ 53 const fullBody = Buffer.concat([headerBuf, fileBuf, trailerBuf]);\n+ 54 ```\n+ 55 关键点：\n+ 56 1. 先把 header 和 trailer 转成 Buffer，再和文件 Buffer 拼接\n+ 57 2. 总长度分别计算后求和\n+ 58 3. 不要用字符串拼接方式算 Content-Length\n+ 59 \n+ 60 **已验证成功的参数组合：**\n+ 61 ```\n+ 62 file_name: \"xxx.jpg\"\n+ 63 file_type: \"image\"\n+ 64 parent_type: \"bitable_image\"\n+ 65 parent_node: {app_token}\n+ 66 size: {文件字节数}\n+ 67 extra: {\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"...\",\"fieldId\":\"...\",\"recordId\":\"...\"}}\n+ 68 file: [二进制文件内容]\n+ 69 Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=...\n+ 70 Content-Length: {totalLen}\n+ 71 ```\n+ 72 \n+ 73 **教训：**\n+ 74 - multipart/form-data 的 Content-Length 必须和实际发送的 body 字节数完全一致\n+ 75 - 二进制文件部分不能先转字符串再拼接，会破坏数据\n+ 76 - 飞书 API 的 params error 有时是 Content-Length 不匹配，不是参数本身问题\n+ 77 \n  32 ### 频哥闲聊\n  33 - 聊了美以伊战事最新进展、黄金价格走势\n  34 - Mac 休眠问题咨询(Sonoma 14.x,pmset 禁用休眠)\n  35 - 对多模态图片识别很感兴趣\n     ...","firstChangedLine":32},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774710408081}}
{"type":"message","id":"8854b5ed","parentId":"cf7d349f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:06:58.600Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me also give the user a clear summary.","thinkingSignature":"4a926f70cdcf38b8becece901ad1ca85095e49049d58f6c3af0c40931c2ce806"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 好，总结一下这个坑的经验：\n\n---\n\n## 附件上传 API 调试总结\n\n**症状：** `code: 1061002 params error` — 一直以为是参数名或格式不对\n\n**实际根因：** `Content-Length` 和实际 body 字节数不一致\n\n---\n\n**出错的写法：**\n```javascript\n// header 用字符串拼\nlet body = `--${boundary}\\r\\n...`\nbody += fileContent.toString('binary')  // ← 这里转字符串会破坏二进制\n// ...\nBuffer.byteLength(body)  // ← 计算不准确\n```\n\n**正确的写法：**\n```javascript\nconst headerBuf = Buffer.from(headerString, 'utf-8')\nconst fileBuf = fs.readFileSync(filePath)        // ← 直接读二进制\nconst trailerBuf = Buffer.from(trailerString, 'utf-8')\nconst totalLen = headerBuf.length + fileBuf.length + trailerBuf.length  // ← 分段计算\n\n// 拼接也要用 Buffer.concat\nconst fullBody = Buffer.concat([headerBuf, fileBuf, trailerBuf])\n```\n\n---\n\n**核心教训：**\n- multipart/form-data 里二进制文件部分**绝对不能**先转字符串再计算长度\n- `Content-Length` 必须和实际 body 字节数精确一致，飞书会校验\n- API 报错 `params error` 有时候是 Content-Length 不对，不是参数本身的问题\n\n---\n\n这个坑花了半小时才找到，以后再遇到类似问题先查 Content-Length 是否精确对齐 🌸\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":75861,"output":332,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":104577,"cost":{"input":0.0227583,"output":0.0003984,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.024859739999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774710408085,"responseId":"06172188cf7dda72352a8de1ba6445dd"}}
