{"type":"message","id":"4b132f5f","parentId":"bceb944d","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:11:02.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me add a LEARNING entry for the geography exam papers knowledge base, and for the Zhou Shen tutoring approach, and the biology SVG image approach.","thinkingSignature":"7e91b8e14a6b52b7ac3d17dd73227c4a295059e8000f23ea259029d13d9860e6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lcjqsr4fysdk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> ~/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md << 'EOF'\n\n## [LRN-20260328-001] best_practice\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-28T23:10:00+08:00\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: docs\n\n### Summary\n成都中考地理 2016-2024 九年真题已系统录入地理导师 skill，形成高频考点库\n\n### Details\n频哥提供了女儿初二地理中考复习资料，我录入了2016-2024年共9年成都中考地理真题的核心考点到地理导师 skill。\n\n**收录情况：**\n- 2016：简录版（秦岭淮河、成都干湿区、成昆铁路）\n- 2017：完整版（地球运动、夏至直射、黄土高原）\n- 2018：完整版（南极科考站、一带一路、三江源）\n- 2019：完整版（粤港澳大湾区、罗斯海新站）\n- 2020：完整版（国家地理位置、台湾红桧、珠峰测量）\n- 2021-2024：完整版（各有侧重）\n\n**高频考点汇总：**\n- 南极科考站（几乎每年）\n- 地球公转/自转（每年）\n- 秦岭淮河一线（高频）\n- 黄土高原水土流失（多次）\n- 北京城市职能（多次）\n- 长江/黄河（多次）\n- 四大地理分区（核心）\n\n### Suggested Action\n出题/辅导时直接调用 skill 参考这些真题规律\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: conversation\n- Related Files: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/skills/geography-tutor/SKILL.md\n- Tags: geography, chengdu-gaokao, skill-building\n\n---\nEOF\necho \"LEARNING entry 1 added\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":85092,"output":445,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":113921,"cost":{"input":0.025527599999999998,"output":0.000534,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027764639999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774710649668,"responseId":"0617227984be8d0dcebd632d586203a5"}}
