{"type":"message","id":"bcfa9bee","parentId":"4a18e03f","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:11:26.161Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me add the biology SVG image generation approach.","thinkingSignature":"ebf158fdd08621b83c928e0d010022f50f2922c2c68c787a80232ba47eae7ff4"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l43xnzepy78q_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> ~/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/LEARNINGS.md << 'EOF'\n\n## [LRN-20260328-003] best_practice\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-28T23:10:00+08:00\n**Priority**: medium\n**Status**: pending\n**Area**: infra\n\n### Summary\nAI 图像生成模型无法可靠渲染中文标签，SVG→QLManage→PNG 是更可靠的出图方案\n\n### Details\n为初二生物辅导出图时，测试了多种 AI 图生图模型（Minimax等），中英文标签均随机乱码，这是底层模型限制，无法通过提示词解决。\n\n**已验证可行的方案（生物模式图）：**\n1. 用 SVG 手绘标注图（文字用 `<text>` 标签，无乱码）\n2. 用 macOS qlmanage 命令转 PNG：\n   ```bash\n   qlmanage -t -s 800 -o /tmp/ photosynthesis.svg\n   # 输出 /tmp/photosynthesis.svg.png\n   ```\n3. 发送图片给用户\n\n**结论：**\n- 生物（模式图）→ SVG 方案可行\n- 地理（真实地图）→ SVG 地图地理数据不准确，改用用户提供教材照片\n- AI 生成图片：废弃，所有模型均无法可靠渲染文字\n\n### Suggested Action\n生物出图题用 SVG 方案；地理图让频哥提供教材照片\n\n### Metadata\n- Source: error\n- Related Files: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-28.md\n- Tags: image-generation, svg, biology, fix-validated\n\n---\nEOF\necho \"LEARNING entry 3 added\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":85937,"output":390,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114711,"cost":{"input":0.025781099999999998,"output":0.000468,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027952139999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774710674279,"responseId":"061722929c1b0a76f63ed13729e8657c"}}
