{"type":"message","id":"9c67e50e","parentId":"ad47b91e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:11:54.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The .learnings files are staged. The git repo is new so there are no commits yet. Let me not commit since the user didn't ask for that, just report what was done.","thinkingSignature":"c0509245a0a1ac860133b1eda2fb9c7ed4bbcd4cfa8a271bf1e3d17e7dfcb6c4"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 已全部录入 `.learnings/` ✅\n\n**今天复盘的内容已记录：**\n\n---\n\n📄 **ERRORS.md**（错误记录）\n> `ERR-20260328-001` — 飞书附件上传 `Content-Length` 计算错误导致 API 报 `params error`\n> - 根因：Node.js 二进制 Buffer 拼接时长度计算不对\n> - 解决方案：header/file/trailer 分段转 Buffer 后用 `Buffer.concat` 拼接，长度相加\n\n---\n\n📝 **LEARNINGS.md**（学到的东西）\n> `LRN-20260328-001` — 成都中考地理 2016-2024 九年真题已录入 skill，高频考点库建立\n> `LRN-20260328-002` — 女儿喜欢周深，辅导用周深语气（温柔+自嘲式幽默），待确认女儿最喜欢哪些歌\n> `LRN-20260328-003` — AI 图片模型无法渲染中文标签，生物图用 SVG→QLManage→PNG 方案\n\n---\n\n📌 **FEATURE_REQUESTS.md**（待完成）\n> `FEAT-20260328-001` — 频哥去问女儿最喜欢周深哪些歌/故事，回复后更新\n\n---\n\n以后遇到问题会实时记进来，不再只存在脑子里了 🌸\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":87113,"output":335,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":115832,"cost":{"input":0.026133899999999998,"output":0.00040199999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028238939999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774710703593,"responseId":"061722affbc0160d620d81e76ed42c1e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2bbe9b56","parentId":"9c67e50e","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:13:08.013Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-28 23:13:06 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b534b4eeac934c3f243b4d356121]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b534b4eeac934c3f243b4d356121\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-28 23:13 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n早上解决错题本录入图片问题的经验也用这个技能总结和复盘一下"}],"timestamp":1774710788003}}
{"type":"message","id":"72462844","parentId":"2bbe9b56","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:13:26.892Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to also record the morning's learnings about the bitable image upload issue. Let me think about what happened in the morning - this was the very first time we solved the bitable upload problem, which led to the MEMORY.md entry about the two different file token systems (drive.files/uploadAll vs drive.v1.media.uploadAll + bitablePerm), and the key discovery that the file_token from cloud drive API couldn't be previewed in bitable.\n\nLet me record this as an error in the ERRORS.md file.","thinkingSignature":"1eb1f5772b1b0b1e592e41a61900c0d0612c3bea3feb7220d12f2fa5714ff7e8"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0yo3dzdk30l9_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat >> ~/.openclaw/workspace/.learnings/ERRORS.md << 'EOF'\n\n## [ERR-20260328-002] feishu_bitable_file_token_preview_404\n\n**Logged**: 2026-03-28T23:13:00+08:00\n**Priority**: critical\n**Status**: resolved\n**Area**: infra\n\n### Summary\n飞书云盘 API 上传的 file_token 在 bitable 附件字段中预览显示 404\n\n### Error\n上传后 file_token 写入 bitable 记录，附件显示但点击预览是 404 页面\n\n### Context\n**问题现象：**\n- 用 `drive/v1/files/upload_all` + `parent_type=bitable_file` 上传，返回 file_token\n- 把 token 写入 bitable 记录「原图」字段\n- 附件图标显示正常，但点击打开是 404\n\n**根本原因：**\n飞书有两套独立的文件存储系统：\n- 云盘 API（drive/v1/files/upload_all）→ 返回**通用 file_token**，只能在云盘里预览\n- bitable 专用 API（drive/v1/files/upload_all + extra.bitablePerm）→ 返回**bitable 专用 token**，才能在附件字段里预览\n\n**教训：**\n- API 返回成功 ≠ 附件能正常预览\n- 两套系统 token 不通用，工具描述容易让人以为通用\n\n### Suggested Fix\n上传到 bitable 附件字段时，必须：\n1. 使用 `extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"...\",\"fieldId\":\"...\",\"recordId\":\"...\"}}` 参数\n2. parent_type 用 `bitable_image`（图片）或 `bitable_file`（文件）\n3. 不能用云盘的 `bitable_file` parent_type，必须用 extra 里的 bitablePerm\n\n**工具层面：**\n- `feishu_doc_media` 工具的 `bitable_upload` action（hidden）自动处理这些\n- 当工具不可用时，用 curl 直接调 API 需要手动加 extra.bitablePerm\n\n### Metadata\n- Reproducible: yes\n- Related Files: /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md, /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-28.md\n- See Also: ERR-20260328-001（晚上又一次踩同样的坑，用 Buffer.concat 解决）\n\n---\nEOF\necho \"added\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":632,"cacheRead":112897,"cacheWrite":2723,"totalTokens":116379,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0007584,"cacheRead":0.006773819999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0010211250000000001,"total":0.008591445}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774710788034,"responseId":"061723046b38ea131e705ca5d68594c3"}}
