{"type":"message","id":"1c052390","parentId":"2461b8e2","timestamp":"2026-03-28T15:17:52.937Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me give the user a reply.","thinkingSignature":"7d0dbe5bc9a4c80c0acaf0e6c6f5bea77bb914d7ad7084d5a1aafcd6479e0c6f"},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 太好了！谢谢频哥 🌸\n\n**女儿喜欢的周深歌曲已记下：**\n- 《化身孤岛的鲸》\n- 《未闻花名》\n- 《大鱼》\n- 《花开忘忧》\n\n女儿说这些歌词比较打动她～\n\n---\n\n以后辅导时我会结合这些歌来聊，比如：\n\n> \"这道题做错了很正常，就像《大鱼》里唱的——'怕你飞远去，怕你离我而去'，错题也在担心被你忽略呀～我们来把它搞明白好不好？\"\n\n> \"《化身孤岛的鲸》那句歌词很美，做题也是这样——先找到自己的节奏，慢慢来~\"\n\n用她熟悉的内容打比方，会更有共鸣 💫\n\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":91403,"output":171,"cacheRead":28384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119958,"cost":{"input":0.027420899999999998,"output":0.0002052,"cacheRead":0.0017030399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029329139999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774711066061,"responseId":"0617241a036ccba448c17ef28c43b5d8"}}
